        <term_definitions language="it">
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>Dettagli su una specifica condizione di salute, una lesione, una disabilità o un qualsiasi altro problema individuato su un individuo che abbia un impatto sul benessere fisico, mentale e/o sociale.</description>
                <text>Problema/Diagnosi</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0001">
                <description>@ internal @</description>
                <text>structure</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0002">
                <description>Nome/identificativo del problema o della diagnosi.</description>
                <text>Nome del problema/diagnosi</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0003">
                <description>Data/ora, stimate o effettive, in cui la diagnosi o il problema sono stati riconosciuti da un operatore sanitario.</description>
                <text>Data/ora di riconoscimento clinico</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0005">
                <description>Una valutazione generale della severità del problema o della diagnosi.</description>
                <text>Severità</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0009">
                <description>Descrizione narrativa del problema o della diagnosi.</description>
                <text>Descrizione clinica</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0012">
                <description>Identificativo di un semplice sito corporeo per per la localizzazione del problema o della diagnosi.</description>
                <text>Sito corporeo</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0030">
                <description>Data/ora, stimate o effettive, della risoluzione o remissione del problema o della diagnosi come determinato da un operatore sanitario.</description>
                <text>Data/ora di risoluzione</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0032">
                <description>@ internal @</description>
                <text>Tree</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0039">
                <description>Una descrizione strutturata della localizzazione anatomica a cui il problema o la diagnosi si riferiscono.</description>
                <text>Dettagli strutturati del sito corporeo</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0043">
                <description>Ulteriori dettagli richiesti per memorizzare attributi specifici del problema o della diagnosi.</description>
                <text>Ulteriori dettagli</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0046">
                <description>Dettagli strutturati per descrivere aspetti del processo diagnostico specifici in relazione alla localizzazione, dominio, episodio o workflow.</description>
                <text>Stato</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0047">
                <description>Il problema o la diagnosi non interferiscono con la normale attività o potrebbero causare problemi di salute salute se non trattati.</description>
                <text>Lieve</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0048">
                <description>Il problema o la diagnosi interferiscono con la normale attività o causerebbero problemi di salute se non trattati.</description>
                <text>Moderato</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0049">
                <description>Il problema o la diagnosi impediscono la normale attività o causerebbero problemi di salute importanti se non trattati.</description>
                <text>Severo</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0069">
                <description>Informazioni aggiuntive sul problema o diagnosi non catturate in altri campi.</description>
                <text>Commento</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0070">
                <description>La data in cui questo record di Problema/Diagnosi è stato aggiornato l'ultima volta.</description>
                <text>Ultimo aggiornamento</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0071">
                <description>Informazioni aggiuntive necessarie per registrare specifici contenuti locali o per allinearsi con altri modelli/formalismi di riferimento.</description>
                <text>Estensione</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0072">
                <description>Descrizione testuale del decorso del problema o della diagnosi a partire dall'insorgenza.</description>
                <text>Decorso</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0073">
                <description>Grado di certezza nell'identificazione della diagnosi.</description>
                <text>Certezza diagnostica</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0074">
                <description>La diagnosi è identificata con un basso livello di certezza.</description>
                <text>Sospetto</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0075">
                <description>La diagnosi è identificata con un alto livello di certezza.</description>
                <text>Probabile</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0076">
                <description>La diagnosi è stata confermata in base a criteri riconosciuti.</description>
                <text>Confermato</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0077">
                <description>Data/ora, stimate o effettive, in cui sono stati per la prima volta osservati i sintomi del problema/diagnosi.</description>
                <text>Data/ora di insorgenza</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0078">
                <description>*A cause, set of causes, or manner of causation of the problem or diagnosis.(en)</description>
                <text>*Cause (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0079">
                <description>*Specific variant or subtype of the Diagnosis, if relevant. (en)</description>
                <text>*Variant (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0080">
                <description></description>
                <text>*DV_TEXT (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>Dettagli su una specifica condizione di salute, una lesione, una disabilità o un qualsiasi altro problema individuato su un individuo che abbia un impatto sul benessere fisico, mentale e/o sociale.</description>
                <text>Problema/Diagnosi</text>
            </items>
        </term_definitions>
        <term_definitions language="fr">
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>Informations détaillées concernant un état de santé, une blessure, un handicap ou tout autre problème identifié ayant une incidence sur le bien-être physique, mental et/ou social d’une personne.</description>
                <text>Problème/Diagnostic</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0001">
                <description>@ internal @</description>
                <text>structure</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0002">
                <description>Identification du problème ou du diagnostic, par son nom.</description>
                <text>Nom du problème/diagnostic</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0003">
                <description>Date/heure estimées ou réelles auxquelles le diagnostic ou le problème a été reconnue par un professionnel de santé.</description>
                <text>Date/heure de reconnaissance clinique</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0005">
                <description>Évaluation de la gravité globale du problème ou du diagnostic.</description>
                <text>Gravité</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0009">
                <description>Description narrative du problème ou du diagnostic.</description>
                <text>Description clinique</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0012">
                <description>Identification d’une simple partie du corps où se situe le problème ou le diagnostic.</description>
                <text>Site corporel</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0030">
                <description>Date/heure estimées ou réelles de la résolution ou de la rémission de ce problème ou de ce diagnostic, telles que déterminées par un professionnel de santé.</description>
                <text>Date/heure de résolution</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0032">
                <description>@ internal @</description>
                <text>Tree</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0039">
                <description>Localisation anatomique structurée du problème ou du diagnostic.</description>
                <text>Site corporel structuré</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0043">
                <description>Détails supplémentaires à enregistrer en tant qu’attributs spécifiques à ce problème ou à ce diagnostic.</description>
                <text>Détails spécifiques</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0046">
                <description>Informations structurées concernant les aspects du processus diagnostique liés au lieu, au domaine, à l’épisode ou au flux de travail.</description>
                <text>Statut</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0047">
                <description>Le problème ou le diagnostic n’entrave pas l’activité normale, mais peut nuire à la santé s’il n’est pas traité.</description>
                <text>Légère</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0048">
                <description>Le problème ou le diagnostic perturbe le déroulement normal des activités ou, s’il n’est pas traité, risque de nuire à la santé.</description>
                <text>Modéré</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0049">
                <description>Le problème ou le diagnostic empêche l’activité normale ou portera gravement atteinte à la santé s’il n’est pas traité.</description>
                <text>Grave</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0069">
                <description>Description complémentaire du problème ou du diagnostic non reprise dans d’autres champs.</description>
                <text>Commentaire</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0070">
                <description>Date de la dernière mise à jour de ce problème ou de ce diagnostic.</description>
                <text>Dernière mise à jour</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0071">
                <description>Informations supplémentaires nécessaires pour représenter un contenu local ou pour assurer l’alignement avec d’autres modèles de référence ou formalismes.</description>
                <text>Extension</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0072">
                <description>Description narrative de l'évolution du problème ou du diagnostic depuis son apparition.</description>
                <text>Description du cours</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0073">
                <description>Le niveau de confiance dans l’identification du diagnostic.</description>
                <text>Certitude diagnostique</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0074">
                <description>Le diagnostic a été établi avec un faible degré de certitude.</description>
                <text>Soupçonné</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0075">
                <description>Le diagnostic a été établi avec un haut degré de certitude.</description>
                <text>Probable</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0076">
                <description>Le diagnostic a été confirmé au regard de critères reconnus.</description>
                <text>Confirmé</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0077">
                <description>Date/heure estimées ou réelles auxquelles les signes ou symptômes du problème ou du diagnostic ont été observés pour la première fois.</description>
                <text>Date/heure d'apparition</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0078">
                <description>Une cause, un ensemble de causes ou un mécanisme de causalité du problème ou du diagnostic.</description>
                <text>Cause</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0079">
                <description>Variante ou sous-type spécifique du diagnostic, le cas échéant.</description>
                <text>Variante</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0080">
                <description>Évaluation globale de l’impact d’un problème de santé sur le patient concerné.</description>
                <text>Impact</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>Informations détaillées concernant un état de santé, une blessure, un handicap ou tout autre problème identifié ayant une incidence sur le bien-être physique, mental et/ou social d’une personne.</description>
                <text>Problème/Diagnostic</text>
            </items>
        </term_definitions>
        <term_definitions language="zh-cn">
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>关于单个已明确的健康状况、损伤、残疾或任何其他影响个人身体健康、心理健康和/或社会福祉的问题/事项的详情。</description>
                <text>问题/诊断</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0001">
                <description>@ internal @</description>
                <text>structure</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0002">
                <description>利用名称对问题或诊断的标识。</description>
                <text>问题/诊断名称</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0003">
                <description>医疗保健专业人员认定当前诊断或问题的估计或实际日期/时间。</description>
                <text>临床认定日期/时间</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0005">
                <description>对于当前问题或诊断的总体严重程度的评估[结果]。</description>
                <text>严重程度</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0009">
                <description>关于当前问题或诊断的叙述性描述。</description>
                <text>临床描述</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0012">
                <description>明确的是代表当前问题或诊断所处解剖位置的简单的身体部位。</description>
                <text>身体部位</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0030">
                <description>医疗保健专业人员所确定的，当前问题或诊断的估计或实际的解决或缓解日期/时间。</description>
                <text>解决日期/时间</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0032">
                <description>@ internal @</description>
                <text>Tree</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0039">
                <description>当前问题或诊断的结构化解剖位置。</description>
                <text>结构化身体部位</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0043">
                <description>记录当前问题或诊断特有的特征属性时所额外需要的详细信息。</description>
                <text>特有详情</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0046">
                <description>关于诊断过程的位置/场所、领域、服务节段/片段（episode）或工作流的特有方面的结构化详细信息。</description>
                <text>状态</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0047">
                <description>如果不加治疗/处理，当前的问题或诊断并不会干扰患者的正常活动或者可能会对其健康造成损害。</description>
                <text>轻度</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0048">
                <description>如果不加治疗/处理，当前的问题或诊断会干扰患者的正常活动或者会对其健康造成损害。</description>
                <text>中度</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0049">
                <description>如果不加治疗/处理，当前的问题或诊断会妨碍患者的正常活动或者会对其健康造成严重的损害。</description>
                <text>重度</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0069">
                <description>其他字段之中并未采集的，关于当前问题或诊断的其他叙述。</description>
                <text>备注</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0070">
                <description>最后更新当前问题或诊断时的日期。</description>
                <text>最后更新日期</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0071">
                <description>采集本地内容或与其他参考模型/形式化体系保持一致时所需的其他信息。</description>
                <text>扩展</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0072">
                <description>关于起始/发病以来当前问题或诊断的过程/进程/病程（course）的叙述性描述。</description>
                <text>进程描述</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0073">
                <description>关于确定当前诊断的置信度水平。</description>
                <text>诊断确定性</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0074">
                <description>确定当前诊断时的确定性较低。</description>
                <text>疑似</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0075">
                <description>确定当前诊断时的确定性较高。</description>
                <text>很可能</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0076">
                <description>确定当前诊断时依据的是公认的[诊断]标准/评判准则。</description>
                <text>确诊/确认</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0077">
                <description>首次观察到/发现当前问题/诊断的症状或体征的估计或实际日期/时间。</description>
                <text>起始日期/时间</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0078">
                <description>问题或诊断的原因、原因集合（成套/成组的原因）或因果作用方式（manner of causation）。</description>
                <text>原因</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0079">
                <description>当前诊断的特定变体/变异类型或亚型/子类型（如果相关/合适）。</description>
                <text>变体/亚型</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0080">
                <description></description>
                <text>*DV_TEXT (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>关于单个已明确的健康状况、损伤、残疾或任何其他影响个人身体健康、心理健康和/或社会福祉的问题/事项的详情。</description>
                <text>问题/诊断</text>
            </items>
        </term_definitions>
        <term_definitions language="es">
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>Detalles sobre una única condición de salud, lesión, discapacidad o cualquier otro problema identificado que afecte al bienestar físico, mental y/o social de un individuo.</description>
                <text>Problema/Diagnóstico</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0001">
                <description>@ internal @</description>
                <text>structure</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0002">
                <description>Identificación del problema o diagnóstico, por nombre.</description>
                <text>Nombre del problema/diagnóstico</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0003">
                <description>Fecha/hora estimada o real en que un profesional sanitario reconoció el diagnóstico o el problema.</description>
                <text>Fecha/Hora de reconocimiento del problema</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0005">
                <description>Evaluación de la gravedad global del problema o diagnóstico.</description>
                <text>Severidad</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0009">
                <description>Descripción narrativa del problema o diagnóstico.</description>
                <text>Descripción clínica</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0012">
                <description>Identificación de una zona corporal sencilla para la localización del problema o diagnóstico.</description>
                <text>Zona corporal</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0030">
                <description>Fecha/hora estimada o real de resolución o remisión de este problema o diagnóstico, determinada por un profesional sanitario.</description>
                <text>Fecha/hora de resolución</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0032">
                <description>@ internal @</description>
                <text>Tree</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0039">
                <description>Ubicación anatómica estructurada del problema o diagnóstico.</description>
                <text>Zona corporal estructurada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0043">
                <description>Detalles que es necesario registrar adicionalmente como atributos únicos de este problema o diagnóstico.</description>
                <text>Detalles específicos</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0046">
                <description>Detalles estructurados para aspectos específicos del proceso de diagnóstico de ubicación, dominio, episodio o flujo de trabajo.</description>
                <text>Estado</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0047">
                <description>El problema o diagnóstico no interfiere con la actividad normal ni puede causar daños a la salud si no se trata.</description>
                <text>Leve</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0048">
                <description>El problema o diagnóstico interfiere en la actividad normal o perjudica la salud si no se trata.</description>
                <text>Moderado</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0049">
                <description>El problema o diagnóstico impide la actividad normal o perjudica gravemente la salud si no se trata.</description>
                <text>Severo</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0069">
                <description>Información adicional sobre el problema o el diagnóstico no recogida en otros campos.</description>
                <text>Comentarios</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0070">
                <description>Fecha de la última actualización de este problema o diagnóstico.</description>
                <text>Última actualización</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0071">
                <description>Información adicional necesaria para registrar el contenido local o para alinearse con otros modelos/formalismos de referencia.</description>
                <text>Ampliación</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0072">
                <description>Descripción narrativa sobre la evolución del problema o diagnóstico desde su aparición.</description>
                <text>Progreso</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0073">
                <description>Nivel de confianza en la identificación del diagnóstico.</description>
                <text>Certeza diagnóstica</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0074">
                <description>El diagnóstico se ha identificado con un bajo nivel de certeza.</description>
                <text>Dudoso</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0075">
                <description>El diagnóstico se ha identificado con un alto nivel de certeza.</description>
                <text>Probable</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0076">
                <description>El diagnóstico se ha confirmado con criterios reconocidos.</description>
                <text>Confirmado</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0077">
                <description>Fecha/hora estimada o real en que se observaron por primera vez los signos o síntomas del problema/diagnóstico.</description>
                <text>Fecha/hora de inicio</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0078">
                <description>Causa, conjunto de causas o manera de causar el problema o diagnóstico.</description>
                <text>Causa</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0079">
                <description>Variante o subtipo específico del Diagnóstico, si procede.</description>
                <text>Variante</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0080">
                <description>Evaluación global del impacto o relevancia de un problema de salud para un paciente concreto.</description>
                <text>Impacto</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>Detalles sobre una única condición de salud, lesión, discapacidad o cualquier otro problema identificado que afecte al bienestar físico, mental y/o social de un individuo.</description>
                <text>Problema/Diagnóstico</text>
            </items>
        </term_definitions>
        <term_definitions language="zh">
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>*Details about a single identified health condition, injury, disability or any other issue which impacts  the physical, mental and/or social wellbeing of an individual.(en)</description>
                <text>问题/诊断</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0001">
                <description>@ internal @ (en)</description>
                <text>structure (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0002">
                <description>*Identification of the problem or diagnosis, by name.(en)</description>
                <text>问题/诊断名字</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0003">
                <description>*Estimated or actual date/time the diagnosis or problem was recognised by a healthcare professional.(en)</description>
                <text>临床认可的日期/时间</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0005">
                <description>*An assessment of the overall severity of the problem or diagnosis.(en)</description>
                <text>严重性</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0009">
                <description>*Narrative description about the problem or diagnosis.(en)</description>
                <text>临床描述</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0012">
                <description>*Identification of a simple body site for the location of the problem or diagnosis.(en)</description>
                <text>身体位置</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0030">
                <description>*Estimated or actual date/time of resolution or remission for this problem or diagnosis, as determined by a healthcare professional.(en)</description>
                <text>解决的日期/时间</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0032">
                <description>@ internal @ (en)</description>
                <text>Tree (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0039">
                <description>*A structured anatomical location for the problem or diagnosis.(en)</description>
                <text>结构化身体位置</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0043">
                <description>*Details that are additionally required to record as unique attributes of this problem or diagnosis.(en)</description>
                <text>详情</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0046">
                <description>描述与位置，域，发作或者工作流程等诊断过程中特定方面相关的结构化细节。</description>
                <text>状态</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0047">
                <description>*The problem or diagnosis does not interfere with normal activity or may cause damage to health if left untreated.(en)</description>
                <text>Mild (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0048">
                <description>*The problem or diagnosis causes interference with normal activity or will damage health if left untreated.(en)</description>
                <text>Moderate (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0049">
                <description>*The problem or diagnosis prevents normal activity or will seriously damage health if left untreated.(en)</description>
                <text>Severe (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0069">
                <description>*Additional narrative about the problem or diagnosis not captured in other fields.(en)</description>
                <text>备注</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0070">
                <description>*The date this problem or diagnosis was last updated.(en)</description>
                <text>最近更新</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0071">
                <description>*Additional information required to capture local content or to align with other reference models/formalisms.(en)</description>
                <text>其他</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0072">
                <description>*Narrative description about the course of the problem or diagnosis since onset.(en)</description>
                <text>过程描述</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0073">
                <description>*The level of confidence in the identification of the diagnosis.(en)</description>
                <text>诊断确定性</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0074">
                <description>*The diagnosis has been identified with a low level of certainty.(en)</description>
                <text>*Suspected (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0075">
                <description>*The diagnosis has been identified with a high level of certainty.(en)</description>
                <text>*Probable (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0076">
                <description>*The diagnosis has been confirmed against recognised criteria.(en)</description>
                <text>*Confirmed (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0077">
                <description>*Estimated or actual date/time that signs or symptoms of the problem/diagnosis were first observed.(en)</description>
                <text>开始日期/时间</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0078">
                <description>*A cause, set of causes, or manner of causation of the problem or diagnosis.(en)</description>
                <text>*Cause (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0079">
                <description>*Specific variant or subtype of the Diagnosis, if relevant. (en)</description>
                <text>*Variant (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0080">
                <description></description>
                <text>*DV_TEXT (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>*Details about a single identified health condition, injury, disability or any other issue which impacts  the physical, mental and/or social wellbeing of an individual.(en)</description>
                <text>问题/诊断</text>
            </items>
        </term_definitions>
        <term_definitions language="nb">
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>Detaljer om én identifisert helsetilstand, skade, funksjonshemming eller annet forhold som påvirker et individs fysiske, mentale og/eller sosiale velvære.</description>
                <text>Problem/diagnose</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0001">
                <description>@ internal @</description>
                <text>structure</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0002">
                <description>Identifisering av problemet eller diagnosen ved hjelp av navn.</description>
                <text>Problem/diagnosenavn</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0003">
                <description>Anslått eller faktisk dato/tid da diagnosen eller problemet ble bekreftet av helsepersonell.</description>
                <text>Dato/tid for klinisk bekreftelse</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0005">
                <description>En vurdering av problemet eller diagnosens overordnede alvorlighetsgrad.</description>
                <text>Alvorlighetsgrad</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0009">
                <description>Fritekstbeskrivelse av problemet eller diagnosen.</description>
                <text>Klinisk beskrivelse</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0012">
                <description>Registrering av et enkelt og usammensatt anatomisk sted der problemet eller diagnosen er lokalisert.</description>
                <text>Anatomisk lokalisering</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0030">
                <description>Estimert eller faktisk dato/tid for bedring eller remisjon av det aktuelle problemet eller diagnosen, fastslått av helsepersonell.</description>
                <text>Dato/tid for bedring/remisjon</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0032">
                <description>@ internal @</description>
                <text>Tree</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0039">
                <description>SLOT som kan inneholde en eller flere detaljerte og strukturerte anatomiske lokaliseringer.</description>
                <text>Strukturert anatomisk lokalisering</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0043">
                <description>Detaljer som er nødvendige for å registrere det aktuelle problemet eller diagnosens unike egenskaper.</description>
                <text>Spesifikke detaljer</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0046">
                <description>Strukturerte detaljer for lokalisering-, fagområde-, episode- eller arbeidsflytsspesifikke aspekter av den diagnostiske prosessen.</description>
                <text>Status</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0047">
                <description>Problemet eller diagnosen forstyrrer ikke normal aktivitet.</description>
                <text>Mild</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0048">
                <description>Problemet eller diagnosen forstyrrer normal aktivitet.</description>
                <text>Moderat</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0049">
                <description>Problemet eller diagnosen forhindrer normal aktivitet.</description>
                <text>Alvorlig</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0069">
                <description>Utdypende fritekst om problemet eller diagnosen, som ikke passer i andre felt.</description>
                <text>Kommentar</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0070">
                <description>Datoen da problemet eller diagnosen sist ble oppdatert.</description>
                <text>Sist oppdatert</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0071">
                <description>Ytterligere informasjon som trengs for å kunne registrere lokalt definert innhold eller for å tilpasse til andre referansemodeller/formalismer.</description>
                <text>Tilleggsinformasjon</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0072">
                <description>Fritekstbeskrivelse av forløpet av problemet eller diagnosen siden debut.</description>
                <text>Forløpsbeskrivelse</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0073">
                <description>Grad av sikkerhet i identifikasjonen av diagnosen.</description>
                <text>Diagnostisk sikkerhet</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0074">
                <description>Diagnoses er identifisert med en lav grad av sikkerhet.</description>
                <text>Mistenkt</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0075">
                <description>Diagnosen er identifisert med en stor grad av sikkerhet.</description>
                <text>Sannsynlig</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0076">
                <description>Diagnosen er bekreftet opp mot anerkjente kriterier.</description>
                <text>Bekreftet</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0077">
                <description>Antatt eller faktisk dato/tid da tegn eller symptomer på problemet eller diagnosen først ble observert.</description>
                <text>Dato/ tid for debut</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0078">
                <description>En årsak, kjede av årsaker til, eller hendelsesforløp forut for problemet eller diagnosen.</description>
                <text>Årsak</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0079">
                <description>Spesifikk variant eller subtype av diagnose, hvis det er relevant.</description>
                <text>Variant</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0080">
                <description>Overordnet vurdering av innvirkningen et helseproblem har for individet.</description>
                <text>Innvirkning</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>Detaljer om én identifisert helsetilstand, skade, funksjonshemming eller annet forhold som påvirker et individs fysiske, mentale og/eller sosiale velvære.</description>
                <text>Problem/diagnose</text>
            </items>
        </term_definitions>
        <term_definitions language="es-ar">
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>Detalles acerca de una condición de salud, lesión, incapacidad o cualquier otra cuerstión, univocamente identificadas, que impacta sobre el bienestar físico, mental y/o social de un individuo</description>
                <text>Problema/Diagnóstico</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0001">
                <description>*@ internal @(en)</description>
                <text>*structure(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0002">
                <description>Identificación del problema o diagnóstico, por nombre.</description>
                <text>Nombre del problema/diagnóstico</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0003">
                <description>Fecha y hora estimadas o confirmadas en las cuales el diagnóstico o problema fue reconocido por el profesional de la salud.</description>
                <text>Fecha y hora del reconocimiento clínico</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0005">
                <description>Una evaluación de la severidad general del problema o diagnóstico.</description>
                <text>Severidad</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0009">
                <description>Descripción narrativa del problema o diagnóstico.</description>
                <text>Descripción clínica</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0012">
                <description>Identificación de un sitio corporal simple para la localización o el problema.</description>
                <text>Sitio corporal</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0030">
                <description>Fecha y hora estimadas o confirmadas en las cuales este problema o diagnóstico remitió o se resolvió, determinadas de un profesional de la salud.</description>
                <text>Fecha/hora de resolución</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0032">
                <description>*@ internal @(en)</description>
                <text>*Tree(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0039">
                <description>una localización anatómica estructurada para el problema o diagnóstico.</description>
                <text>Sitio corporal estructurado</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0043">
                <description>Detalles adicionales requeridos para registrar como atributos unívocos del este problema o diagnóstico.</description>
                <text>Detalles específicos</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0046">
                <description>Detalles estructurados para los aspectos específicos de localización, dominio, episodio o decurso del proceso diagnóstico.</description>
                <text>Estado</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0047">
                <description>El problema o diagnóstico no interfiere con la actividad normal o puede causar daños a la salud si no es tratado.</description>
                <text>Leve</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0048">
                <description>El problema o diagnóstico interfiere con la actividad normal o puede dañar la salud si no es tratado.</description>
                <text>Moderado</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0049">
                <description>El problema o diagnóstico impide la actividad normal o pude dañar seriamente la salud si no es tratado.</description>
                <text>Severo</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0069">
                <description>Narrativa adicional acerca del problema o diagnóstico que no ha sido consignada en otros campos.</description>
                <text>Comentario</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0070">
                <description>La fecha de la última actualización de este problema o diagnóstico.</description>
                <text>Última actualización.</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0071">
                <description>Información adicional requerida para consignar contenidos locales o alinear con otros modelos de referencia o formalismos.</description>
                <text>Extensión</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0072">
                <description>Descripción narrativa del curso del problema o diagnóstico desde su aparición.</description>
                <text>Descripción del curso</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0073">
                <description>El nivel de certeza de la identificación del diagnóstico.</description>
                <text>Certeza diagnóstica</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0074">
                <description>El diagnóstico ha sido identificado con un bajo nivel de certeza.</description>
                <text>Sospechado</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0075">
                <description>El diagnóstico ha sido identificado con un alto nivel de certeza.</description>
                <text>Probable</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0076">
                <description>El diagnóstico ha sido confirmado en base a criterios reconocidos.</description>
                <text>Confirmado</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0077">
                <description>Fecha y hora estimadas o confirmadas en las cuales los signos o síntomas del problema fueron observados por primera vez.</description>
                <text>Fecha/hora de aparición</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0078">
                <description>*A cause, set of causes, or manner of causation of the problem or diagnosis.(en)</description>
                <text>*Cause (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0079">
                <description>*Specific variant or subtype of the Diagnosis, if relevant. (en)</description>
                <text>*Variant (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0080">
                <description></description>
                <text>*DV_TEXT (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>Detalles acerca de una condición de salud, lesión, incapacidad o cualquier otra cuerstión, univocamente identificadas, que impacta sobre el bienestar físico, mental y/o social de un individuo</description>
                <text>Problema/Diagnóstico</text>
            </items>
        </term_definitions>
        <term_definitions language="nl">
            <items id="at0077">
                <description>Geschatte of precieze datum/tijd dat de eerste tekenen of symptomen van het probleem of de diagnose werden opgemerkt.</description>
                <text>Datum/tijd van aanvang</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0076">
                <description>*The diagnosis has been confirmed against recognised criteria.(en)</description>
                <text>*Confirmed(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0075">
                <description>*The diagnosis has been identified with a high level of certainty.(en)</description>
                <text>*Probable(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0074">
                <description>*The diagnosis has been identified with a low level of certainty.(en)</description>
                <text>*Suspected(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0073">
                <description>*The level of confidence in the identification of the diagnosis.(en)</description>
                <text>*Diagnostic certainty(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0072">
                <description>*Narrative description about the course of the problem or diagnosis since onset.(en)</description>
                <text>*Course description(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0071">
                <description>*Additional information required to capture local content or to align with other reference models/formalisms.(en)</description>
                <text>*Extension(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0070">
                <description>*The date this problem or diagnosis was last updated.(en)</description>
                <text>*Last updated(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0069">
                <description>*Additional narrative about the problem or diagnosis not captured in other fields.(en)</description>
                <text>*Comment(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0049">
                <description>*The problem or diagnosis prevents normal activity or will seriously damage health if left untreated.(en)</description>
                <text>*Severe(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0048">
                <description>*The problem or diagnosis causes interference with normal activity or will damage health if left untreated.(en)</description>
                <text>*Moderate(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0047">
                <description>*The problem or diagnosis does not interfere with normal activity or may cause damage to health if left untreated.(en)</description>
                <text>*Mild(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0046">
                <description>*Structured details for location-, domain-, episode- or workflow-specific aspects of the diagnostic process.(en)</description>
                <text>*Status(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0043">
                <description>*Details that are additionally required to record as unique attributes of this problem or diagnosis.(en)</description>
                <text>*Specific details(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0039">
                <description>*A structured anatomical location for the problem or diagnosis.(en)</description>
                <text>*Structured body site(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0032">
                <description>*@ internal @(en)</description>
                <text>*Tree(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0030">
                <description>*Estimated or actual date/time of resolution or remission for this problem or diagnosis, as determined by a healthcare professional.(en)</description>
                <text>*Date/time of resolution(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0012">
                <description>Identificatie van een eenvoudig lichaamsdeel voor de lokatie van het probleem of de diagnose.</description>
                <text>Lichaamsdeel</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0009">
                <description>Verhalende beschrijving van het probleem of de diagnose.</description>
                <text>Klinische beschrijving</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0005">
                <description>*An assessment of the overall severity of the problem or diagnosis.(en)</description>
                <text>*Severity(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0003">
                <description>Geschatte of werkelijke datum/tijd waarop het probleem of de diagnose is herkend door een zorgprofessional.</description>
                <text>Datum/tijd van klinische herkenning</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0002">
                <description>Identificatie van het probleem of de diagnose bij naam.&#13;
                            </description>
                <text>Naam van het probleem / de diagnose</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0001">
                <description>*@ internal @(en)</description>
                <text>*structure(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>Informatie over een enkele vast te stellen medische aandoening, een letsel, beperking of andere zaak die invloed heeft op de fysieke, mentale en/of het sociale welbevinden van een individu.</description>
                <text>Probleem/Diagnose</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0078">
                <description>*A cause, set of causes, or manner of causation of the problem or diagnosis.(en)</description>
                <text>*Cause (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0079">
                <description>*Specific variant or subtype of the Diagnosis, if relevant. (en)</description>
                <text>*Variant (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0080">
                <description></description>
                <text>*DV_TEXT (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>Informatie over een enkele vast te stellen medische aandoening, een letsel, beperking of andere zaak die invloed heeft op de fysieke, mentale en/of het sociale welbevinden van een individu.</description>
                <text>Probleem/Diagnose</text>
            </items>
        </term_definitions>
        <term_definitions language="ca">
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>Detalls sobre una única condició de salut, lesió, discapacitat o qualsevol altre problema identificat que afecti el benestar físic, mental o social d’una persona. </description>
                <text>Problema/Diagnòstic</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0001">
                <description>@ internal @</description>
                <text>structure</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0002">
                <description>Identificació del problema o diagnòstic pel nom.</description>
                <text>Nom del Problema/Diagnòstic</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0003">
                <description>Data/hora estimada o real en què un professional sanitari va declarar el diagnòstic o problema.</description>
                <text>Data/hora del diagnòstic clínic</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0005">
                <description>Una avaluació de la severitat global del problema o diagnòstic.</description>
                <text>Severitat</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0009">
                <description>Informació addicional del problema o diagnòstic.</description>
                <text>Descripció clínica</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0012">
                <description>Identificació de la zona del cos per a la localització del problema o diagnòstic.</description>
                <text>Zona del cos</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0030">
                <description>Data/hora estimada o real de resolució o remissió d'aquest problema o diagnòstic, determinada per un professional sanitari.</description>
                <text>Data/hora de resolució</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0032">
                <description>@ internal @</description>
                <text>Tree</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0039">
                <description>Localització anatòmica estructurada per al problema o diagnòstic.</description>
                <text>Zona del cos estructurada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0043">
                <description>Detalls que es requereixen addicionalment per a registrar atributs únics d'aquest problema o diagnòstic.</description>
                <text>Detalls específics</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0046">
                <description>Detalls estructurats per a aspectes específics d'ubicació, domini, episodi o flux de treball del procés diagnòstic.</description>
                <text>Estat</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0047">
                <description>El problema o diagnòstic no interfereix amb l'activitat normal ni pot causar danys a la salut si no es tracta.</description>
                <text>Lleu</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0048">
                <description>El problema o diagnòstic interfereix amb l'activitat normal o pot causar danys a la salut si no es tracta.</description>
                <text>Moderat</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0049">
                <description>El problema o diagnòstic impedeix l'activitat normal o causarà danys greus a la salut si no es tracta.</description>
                <text>Greu</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0069">
                <description>Informació descriptiva sobre el problema o diagnòstic no registrada en altres camps.</description>
                <text>Comentaris</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0070">
                <description>La data en què es va actualitzar per última vegada aquest problema o diagnòstic.</description>
                <text>Darrera actualització</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0071">
                <description>Informació addicional necessària per a recollir el contingut local o per alinear-se amb altres models/formalismes de referència.</description>
                <text>Extensió</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0072">
                <description>Informació addicional del curs del problema o diagnòstic des de l'inici.</description>
                <text>Descripció del curs</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0073">
                <description>El nivell de confiança en la identificació del diagnòstic.</description>
                <text>Certesa diagnòstica</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0074">
                <description>El diagnòstic s'ha identificat amb un nivell baix de certesa.</description>
                <text>Sospita</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0075">
                <description>El diagnòstic s'ha identificat amb un alt nivell de certesa.</description>
                <text>Probable</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0076">
                <description>El diagnòstic s'ha confirmat d'acord amb criteris reconeguts.</description>
                <text>Confirmat</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0077">
                <description>Data/hora estimada o real en què es van observar per primera vegada els signes o símptomes del problema/diagnòstic.</description>
                <text>Data/hora de l’aparició</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0078">
                <description>Una causa, conjunt de causes o el mecanisme causal del problema o diagnòstic.</description>
                <text>Causa</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0079">
                <description>Variant o subtipus específic del Diagnòstic, si escau.</description>
                <text>Variant</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0080">
                <description>Avaluació global de l'impacte o rellevància d'un problema de salut per a un pacient concret.</description>
                <text>Impacte</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>Detalls sobre una única condició de salut, lesió, discapacitat o qualsevol altre problema identificat que afecti el benestar físic, mental o social d’una persona. </description>
                <text>Problema/Diagnòstic</text>
            </items>
        </term_definitions>
    </component_terminologies>
    <component_terminologies archetype_id="openEHR-EHR-ACTION.medication.v1" original_language="en">
        <concept_code>at0000</concept_code>
        <term_definitions language="de">
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>Jede Aktivität in Bezug auf die Planung, Vorbereitung, Rezeptverwaltung, Ausgabe, Verabreichung, Einnahme, Absetzung und anderer Verwendung von Arzneimitteln, Impfstoffen, Nahrungsergänzungsmitteln und anderen therapeutischen Mitteln.</description>
                <text>Arzneimittelanwendung</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0002">
                <description>Für das Arzneimittel wurde ein Rezept ausgestellt.</description>
                <text>Rezept ausgestellt</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0003">
                <description>Das verordnete Arzneimittel ist an einen Patienten ausgegeben worden, z.B. von einer Apotheke.</description>
                <text>Rezept wurde ausgegeben/eingelöst</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0004">
                <description>Das Arzneimittel wurde zum ersten Mal von dem Patienten eingenommen oder ihm verabreicht. Obwohl in einigen Situationen das relevante Datum als erste von mehreren Anwendungen errechenbar ist, kann es in der Grundversorgung sein, dass genaue Verabreichungszeit nicht ohne weiteres verfügbar ist.</description>
                <text>Arzneimittelbehandlung hat begonnen</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0005">
                <description>Das individuelle Arzneimittel wurde neu bewertet, beispielsweise ob das Arzneimittel noch angewendet werden soll. Eine Überprüfung der Arzneimittelliste soll nicht durchgeführt werden.</description>
                <text>Arzneimittel wurde neu bewertet</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0006">
                <description>Eine einzelne Verabreichung des Arzneimittels ist erfolgt.</description>
                <text>Dosis wurde verabreicht</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0007">
                <description>Die medikamentöse Behandlung wurde, wie geplant, beendet.</description>
                <text>Arzneimittelbehandlung ist abgeschlossen</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0008">
                <description>Das Rezept wurde aufgrund einer technischen oder pharmazeutischen Störung nicht ausgegeben.</description>
                <text>Verzögerung der Rezeptabgabe</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0009">
                <description>Die Verabreichung des Arzneimittels wurde bis zum Erhalt weiterer Informationen ausgesetzt. Es sollten keine weiteren Dosen, bis zur Bekanntgabe des neuen Startdatums oder bis die Bedingungen erfüllt sind, verabreicht werden. Wenn Sie das Datum/ die Voraussetzungen für den Neustart nach dem Aussetzen festlegen, sollte ein Schritt von "Verabreichung wurde ausgesetzt" und zurück zu "Arzneimittel Startdatum/Voraussetzung" ausgeführt werden.</description>
                <text>Verabreichung wurde ausgesetzt</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0010">
                <description>Ein Rezept wurde für eine vorhandene Arzneimittelverordnung neu ausgestellt.</description>
                <text>Rezept neu ausgestellt</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0011">
                <description>Die Ausstellung des Rezeptes wartet auf die erneute Autorisierung durch einen Arzt.</description>
                <text>Re-Autorisierug des Rezepts ausstehend</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0012">
                <description>Die geplante Arzneimittelbehandlung wurde vor der Verabreichung abgesagt.</description>
                <text>Arzneimittelbehandlung wurde abgesagt</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0013">
                <description>Die geplante Arzneimittelbehandlung wurde vor der Verabreichung verschoben.</description>
                <text>Arzneimittelbehandlung wurde verschoben</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0015">
                <description>Die Verabreichung des Arzneimittels wurde während der Dauer der geplanten Behandlung eingestellt.</description>
                <text>Arzneimittelbehandlung gestoppt</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0016">
                <description>Das Startdatum der Arzneimittelanwendung oder andere Startbedingungen wurden festgelegt.</description>
                <text>Arzneimittel Startdatum/Voraussetzung</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0017">
                <description>@ internal @</description>
                <text>Tree</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0018">
                <description>Eine Gabe des Arzneimittels wurde zurückgehalten und nicht gegeben. Es besteht keine Erwartung, dass sie später verabreicht wird, obwohl die nächste Dosis (falls es eine gibt) gemäß der ursprünglichen Verordnung verabreicht werden sollte.</description>
                <text>Verabreichung einer Dosis wurde ausgelassen</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0020">
                <description>Name des Arzneimittels, eines Impfstoffs oder eines anderen therapeutischen Mittels, welches im Mittelpunkt der Aktivität steht.</description>
                <text>Arzneimittel</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0021">
                <description>Begründung, warum der Prozessschritt für das identifizierte Arzneimittel durchgeführt wurde.</description>
                <text>Begründung</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0024">
                <description>Zur Dokumentation von zusätzlichen Schilderungen über die Aktivitäten oder den Prozessschritt, wenn sie noch nicht in anderen Feldern erfasst wurden. Dabei sollen Einzelheiten zu Abweichungen zwischen durchzuführender Aktion und tatsächlich durchgeführter Aktion erfasst werden.</description>
                <text>Kommentar</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0025">
                <description>Die spezifische Sequenznummer des Prozessschritts wird erfasst.</description>
                <text>Sequenznummer</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0030">
                <description>@ internal @</description>
                <text>Tree</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0033">
                <description>Jede Anweisung, Anleitung oder Empfehlung, die dem Patienten oder der Pflegekraft zum Zeitpunkt eines Prozessschrittes übermittelt wird.</description>
                <text>Patientenanweisung</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0039">
                <description>Eine große Änderung der Verordnung war erforderlich, die dazu führte, dass diese Verordnung gestoppt und eine Ersatzverordnung gestartet wurde.</description>
                <text>Größere Änderung der Verordnung</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0041">
                <description>Die Arzneimittelverordnung wurde so geändert, dass keine neue Verordnung/neues Rezept nach den lokalen klinischen Regeln ausgestellt werden muss.</description>
                <text>Geringfügige Änderung der Verordnung</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0043">
                <description>Das Datum/die Uhrzeit, an dem die Aktion mit dem Arzneimittel eingeplant war.</description>
                <text>Ursprünglich geplantes Datum/Uhrzeit</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0044">
                <description>Die Verabreichung einer Dosis hat sich verzögert, wird aber so schnell wie möglich erfolgen.</description>
                <text>Verabreichung einer Dosis wurde verschoben</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0053">
                <description>Weitere strukturierte Details zu der Aktivität, möglicherweise speziell zu einem Prozessschritt.</description>
                <text>Zusätzliche Details</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0085">
                <description>Zusätzliche Informationen zur Erfassung lokaler Inhalte oder Anpassung an andere Referenzmodelle/Formalismen.</description>
                <text>Erweiterung</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0103">
                <description>Eindeutige ID der Arzneimittelverordnung.</description>
                <text>ID der Verordnung</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0104">
                <description>Strukturierte Informationen über das Arzneimittel inklusive Stärke, Form und Inhaltsstoffe.</description>
                <text>Arzneimitteldetails</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0106">
                <description>Die ursprüngliche Verordnung des Arzneimittels wurde erneut genehmigt, um eine wiederholte Verschreibung oder Abgabe zu ermöglichen. In einigen Ländern, wie z.B. Deutschland, muss unter diesen Umständen ein völlig neues Rezept ausgestellt werden.</description>
                <text>Rezept ist re-autorisiert</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0109">
                <description>Das Arzneimittel wurde empfohlen, aber es wurden keine Schritte unternommen, um die Verschreibung/Verordnung einzuleiten.</description>
                <text>Arzneimittel empfohlen</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0131">
                <description>Spezifische Angaben zur Dosis des Arzneimittels.</description>
                <text>Dosis</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0132">
                <description>Substitutionsmaßnahmen, die von der Person ergriffen werden, die das Medikament verabreicht oder ausgibt.</description>
                <text>Substitution</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0133">
                <description>Die Ursache oder die Begründung für die durchgeführte Substitution.</description>
                <text>Grund für die Substitution</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0138">
                <description>Ein Arzneimittel wurde substituiert, welches bioäquivalent zu dem Angeforderten ist.</description>
                <text>Substitution wurde durchgeführt</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0139">
                <description>Obwohl es nach der Arzneimittelverordnung erlaubt gewesen wäre, wurde nicht mit einem bioäquivalenten Arzneimittel substituiert.</description>
                <text>Substitution wurde nicht durchgeführt</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0140">
                <description>Details über die Körperstelle und über die Verabreichung des Arzneimittels.</description>
                <text>Details zur Verabreichung</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0141">
                <description>Strukturierte Beschreibung der Körperstelle, an der das Arzneimittel angewendet wird.</description>
                <text>Körperstelle</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0142">
                <description>Genaue Beschreibung der Körperstelle, an der das Arzneimittel, der Impfstoff oder ein therapeutisches Produkt angewendet wird.</description>
                <text>Lokalisation</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0143">
                <description>Die Technik oder das Gerät mit dem das verschriebene Arzneimittel verabreicht wird oder werden soll.</description>
                <text>Methode der Verabreichung</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0144">
                <description>Details zu der Vorrichtung mit dem das Arzneimittel verabreicht wird.</description>
                <text>Verabreichungsmittel</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0145">
                <description>Der Rezeptentwurf wurde erstellt und wartet auf die Bestätigung durch einen autorisierten Arzt. Kann auch verwendet werden, wenn die Re-autorisierung gebündelt erfolgt. Dieser "careflow_step" hat den Status "geplant" oder "aktiv", was die Notwendigkeit widerspiegelt, sowohl Neuaufträge als auch erneut autorisierte Aufträge zu bearbeiten.</description>
                <text>Rezept wartet auf Genehmigung</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0147">
                <description>Die Angabe darüber, auf welche Art das verordnete Arzneimittel am Körper des Patienten angewendet wird.</description>
                <text>Verabreichungsweg</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0148">
                <description>*The medication has been physically prepared. (en)</description>
                <text>Arzneimittel wurde vorbereitet</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0149">
                <description>Der Prozessschritt wurde durch eine unabhängige Person überprüft.</description>
                <text>Nachkontrolliert?</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0150">
                <description>Das Rezept wurde vor der Ausstellung widerrufen.</description>
                <text>Rezept wurde widerrufen</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0151">
                <description>Das Rezept ist ungültig geworden oder ist abgelaufen, ohne das es eingelöst wurde.</description>
                <text>Rezept ist ungültig oder abgelaufen</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0152">
                <description>Das Rezept wurde erfolgreich ausgeführt/eingehalten.</description>
                <text>Rezept wurde ausgeführt</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0153">
                <description>Das Arzneimittel ist offiziell zur Anwendung genehmigt.</description>
                <text>Arzneimittel wurde genehmigt</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0154">
                <description>Das Datum/die Uhrzeit an dem die Arzneimittelbehandlung wieder begonnen wird, gemäß dem "Verabreichung wurde ausgesetzt"- Schritt.</description>
                <text>Datum/Uhrzeit des Neustarts</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0155">
                <description>Das Kriterium, das den Neustart der Arzneimittelbehandlung auslöst, gemäß dem Schritt "Verabreichung wurde ausgesetzt".</description>
                <text>Kriterium des Neustarts</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0156">
                <description>Der klinische Grund für die Aktivität mit dem Arzneimittel.</description>
                <text>Klinische Indikation</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0157">
                <description>*The prepared medication has been double checked. (en)</description>
                <text>*Medication double checked (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0158">
                <description>*An administration of a dose of the medication was started but was subsequently aborted. (en)</description>
                <text>*Dose administration aborted (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>Jede Aktivität in Bezug auf die Planung, Vorbereitung, Rezeptverwaltung, Ausgabe, Verabreichung, Einnahme, Absetzung und anderer Verwendung von Arzneimitteln, Impfstoffen, Nahrungsergänzungsmitteln und anderen therapeutischen Mitteln.</description>
                <text>Arzneimittelanwendung</text>
            </items>
        </term_definitions>
        <term_definitions language="ru">
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>*Any activity related to the planning, scheduling, prescription management, dispensing, administration, cessation and other use of a medication, vaccine, nutritional product or other therapeutic item.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication management(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0002">
                <description>*A prescription has been issued for the medication.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription issued(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0003">
                <description>*The ordered medication has been dispensed, for example from a pharmacy to the patient.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription dispensed(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0004">
                <description>*The medication has been taken by, or administered to, the patient for the first time. Although in some settings this significant date may be computable as the first of several administrations, in other settings, such as primary care, specific administration dates are not readily available.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication course commenced(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0005">
                <description>*The specific medication item has been reviewed, as planned. This is not intended to capture review of the whole medication list.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication course reviewed(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0006">
                <description>*A single administration of the medication has taken place.(en)</description>
                <text>*Dose administered(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0007">
                <description>*The medication course has been completed as planned.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication course completed(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0008">
                <description>*The prescription has not been dispensed due to a technical or pharamaceutical supply issue.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription supply delayed(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0009">
                <description>*The administration of the medication has been suspended until further notice. No further doses should be given until the restart date or conditions have been met. When setting the date/conditions for restart after suspending, a step from ‘Administrations suspended’ and back to 'Medication start date/condition set' should be performed.(en)</description>
                <text>*Administrations suspended(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0010">
                <description>*A prescription token has been re-issued for an existing medication order.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription re-issued(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0011">
                <description>*Reissuing of this prescription is not available without some intervention.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription re-issue suspended(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0012">
                <description>*The planned course of medication has been cancelled prior to any administration.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication course cancelled(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0013">
                <description>*The scheduled medication course has been postponed prior to any administration.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication course postponed(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0015">
                <description>*The administration of this medication has been ceased after the first dose has been administered, but before intended completion of the course.  (en)</description>
                <text>*Medication course stopped(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0016">
                <description>*The time to start this medication, or other starting condition, has been set.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication start date/condition set(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0017">
                <description>*@ internal @(en)</description>
                <text>*Tree(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0018">
                <description>*The administration of a medication has been withheld and not given. There is no expectation that it will be given later, though the next dose (if any) should be administered according to the original order.(en)</description>
                <text>*Dose administration omitted(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0020">
                <description>*Name of the medication, vaccine or other therapeutic/prescribable item which was the focus of the activity.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication item(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0021">
                <description>*Reason that the pathway step for the identified medication was carried out.(en)</description>
                <text>*Reason(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0024">
                <description>*Additional narrative about the activity or care pathway step not captured in other fields, including details of any variance between the intended action and the action actually performed.(en)</description>
                <text>*Comment(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0025">
                <description>*The sequence number specific to the activity being recorded.(en)</description>
                <text>*Sequence number(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0030">
                <description>*@ internal @(en)</description>
                <text>*Tree(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0033">
                <description>*Any guidance, instructions or advice given to the subject of care or personal carer at the time of the pathway step.(en)</description>
                <text>*Patient guidance(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0039">
                <description>*A major change to the order was required, resulting in this order being stopped and a replacement order being started.(en)</description>
                <text>*Major change to order.(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0041">
                <description>*The medication order has been changed in a manner which does not require a new instruction/order to be issued, according to local clinical rules.(en)</description>
                <text>*Minor change to order(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0043">
                <description>*The datetime at which the medication action was scheduled to occur.(en)</description>
                <text>*Original scheduled date/time(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0044">
                <description>*Administration of a dose of mediciation has been delayed but is expected to be given as soon as possible.(en)</description>
                <text>*Dose administration deferred(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0053">
                <description>*Further structured details of the action, possibly specific to a pathway step.(en)</description>
                <text>*Additional details(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0085">
                <description>**(en)</description>
                <text>*Cluster(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0103">
                <description>*Unique identifier for the medication order.(en)</description>
                <text>*Order ID(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0104">
                <description>*Structured details about the medication including strength, form and constituent substances.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication details(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0106">
                <description>*The original medication order has been re-authorised to allow repeat prescription or dispensing. In some jurisdictions an entirely new order must be issued in these circumstances.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription re-authorised(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0109">
                <description>*The medication has been recommended but no steps have been taken to initiate prescribing.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication recommended(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0131">
                <description>*Specific details about the amount of the medication item.(en)</description>
                <text>*Amount(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0132">
                <description>*Subsitution action taken by the person administering or dispensing the drug.(en)</description>
                <text>*Substitution(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0133">
                <description>*The reason or justification for the substitution action taken.(en)</description>
                <text>*Substitution reason(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0138">
                <description>*A medication was substituted which is bioequivalent to that ordered.(en)</description>
                <text>*Substitution performed(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0139">
                <description>*Although allowed by the medication order a bioequvalent medication was not substituted.(en)</description>
                <text>*Substitution not performed(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0140">
                <description>*Details of body site and administration of the medication.(en)</description>
                <text>*Administration details(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0141">
                <description>*Structured description of the site of administration of the ordered item.(en)</description>
                <text>*Body site(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0142">
                <description>*Structured description of the site of administration of the medication, vaccine or therapeutic good.(en)</description>
                <text>*Structured body site(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0143">
                <description>*The technique or device by which the ordered item was, or is to be, administered.(en)</description>
                <text>*Administration method(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0144">
                <description>*Details of the medical device used to assist administration of the medication.(en)</description>
                <text>*Administration device(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0145">
                <description>*Draft prescription has been prepared and is awaiting confirmation from an authorised clinician. May be used where reauthorisations are performed as a batch. This careflow_step may have a status of 'planned' or 'active', reflecting the need to to handle new orders as well as re-authorised orders.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription awaiting authorisation(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0147">
                <description>*The route by which the ordered item was, or is to be, administered into the subject's body.(en)</description>
                <text>*Route(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0148">
                <description>*The medication has been physically prepared. (en)</description>
                <text>*Medication prepared(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0149">
                <description>*The action step has been checked by a separate individual.(en)</description>
                <text>*Double-checked?(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0150">
                <description>*The prescription was cancelled prior to being issued.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription cancelled(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0151">
                <description>*Prescription has been invalidated or has expired without being fulfilled.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription invalid or expired(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0152">
                <description>*The prescription has been fulfilled successfully.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription fulfilled(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0153">
                <description>*The medication has been formally authorised for use.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication authorised(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0154">
                <description>*The date/time on which the medication course is set to restart, as per the "Medication restart date/condition set" pathway step.(en)</description>
                <text>*Restart date/time(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0155">
                <description>*The criterion which triggers the medication course to restart, as per the "Medication restart date/condition set" pathway step.(en)</description>
                <text>*Restart criterion(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0156">
                <description>*The clinical reason for the medication activity. (en)</description>
                <text>*Clinical indication (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0157">
                <description>*The prepared medication has been double checked. (en)</description>
                <text>*Medication double checked (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0158">
                <description>*An administration of a dose of the medication was started but was subsequently aborted. (en)</description>
                <text>*Dose administration aborted (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>*Any activity related to the planning, scheduling, prescription management, dispensing, administration, cessation and other use of a medication, vaccine, nutritional product or other therapeutic item.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication management(en)</text>
            </items>
        </term_definitions>
        <term_definitions language="sv">
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>Aktiviteter relaterade till planering, schemaläggning, recepthantering, dosering, administrering, avbrott från eller användning av läkemedel, vaccinering, näringspreparat eller annan terapeutisk produkt.</description>
                <text>Hantering av läkemedelsregim</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0002">
                <description>En ordination av läkemedlet har utfärdats.</description>
                <text>Utfärdad ordination</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0003">
                <description>Det ordinerade läkemedlet har dispenserats, exempelvis från ett apotek till patienten.</description>
                <text>Utdelad ordination</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0004">
                <description>Läkemedlet har tagits av eller administrerats till patienten för första gången. I vissa fall kan startdatum för varje administrationstillfälle finnas tillgängligt, medan det i andra fall (såsom i primärvården) inte gör det.</description>
                <text>Påbörjad läkemedelsbehandling</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0005">
                <description>Omprövning av det enskilda läkemedlet, exempelvis huruvida medicineringen ska fortskrida. Syftet är inte att skapa en översyn av läkemedelslistan.</description>
                <text>Omprövning av läkemedel</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0006">
                <description>Engångsadministrering av läkemedlet.</description>
                <text>Administrerad dos</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0007">
                <description>Läkemedelsbehandlingen har slutförts som planerat.</description>
                <text>Fullföljd läkemedelsbehandling</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0008">
                <description>Ordinationen har inte delats ut på grund av ett teknisk eller faramaceutiskt leveransproblem.</description>
                <text>Försenad receptleverans</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0009">
                <description>Administreringen av läkemedlet har avbrutits tills vidare. Inga ytterligare doser ska ges förrän ett nytt startdatum har angivits eller villkoren har uppfyllts. Vid inställning av in datum/villkor för omstart, ska stegen från "Läkemedlets startdatum/fastställda villkor" till "Indragen administrering" utföras på nytt.</description>
                <text>Indragen administrering</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0010">
                <description>En ordination har utfärdats på nytt för en befintlig läkemedelsorder.</description>
                <text>Förnyelse av ordination</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0011">
                <description>Inväntar återauktorisering för ordination av en läkare.</description>
                <text>Återauktorisering av recept inväntas</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0012">
                <description>Schemalagd läkemedelsbehandling som har avbrutits före administrering.</description>
                <text>Avbruten läkemedelsbehandling</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0013">
                <description>Schemalagd läkemedelsbehandling som har blivit uppskjuten före administrering.</description>
                <text>Uppskjuten läkemedelsbehandling</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0015">
                <description>Administreringen av läkemedlet har avbrutits under det planerade förloppet.</description>
                <text>Avbruten läkemedelsbehandling</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0016">
                <description>Tid då medicinering startar, eller vid annat startvillkor.</description>
                <text>Läkemedlets startdatum/fastställda villkor</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0017">
                <description>@ internal @</description>
                <text>Tree</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0018">
                <description>Nekad administrering av läkemedlet. Denna dos förväntas inte att ges vid senare tillfälle, även om en eventuellt nästa dos ska administreras enligt planerat.</description>
                <text>Utelämnad dos</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0020">
                <description>Benämning på läkemedlet, vaccinet eller annan terapeutisk/ordinationsbar artikel som aktiviteten gäller.</description>
                <text>Läkemedelsartikel</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0021">
                <description>Anledningen till att steget för det aktuella läkemedlet utfördes.</description>
                <text>Orsak</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0024">
                <description>Kommentarer avseende den aktivitet eller det vårdsteg som inte beskrivs i övriga fält, inklusive detaljer om eventuell avvikelse mellan den avsedda åtgärden och den faktiska utförda åtgärden.</description>
                <text>Kommentar</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0025">
                <description>Det specifika sekvensnumret för det aktuella vårdsteget.</description>
                <text>Sekvensnummer</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0030">
                <description>@ internal @</description>
                <text>Tree</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0033">
                <description>Vägledning, instruktioner eller råd som ges till patienten eller dennes personliga vårdgivare vid tidpunkten för vårdsteget.</description>
                <text>Patientvägledning</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0039">
                <description>Då en större ändring av ordern krävdes, resulterade detta i att denna order stoppades och en ersättningsorder påbörjades.</description>
                <text>Större orderändring</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0041">
                <description>Läkemedelsordern har ändrats på ett sätt som inte kräver att en ny order ska utfärdas, enligt lokala kliniska regler.</description>
                <text>Mindre orderändring</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0043">
                <description>Tidpunkt då hantering av läkemedelsregim var schemalagd.</description>
                <text>Ursprungligt datum/tid</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0044">
                <description>En dos av läkemedlet har försenats men förväntas administreras så snart som möjligt.</description>
                <text>Uppskjuten dos</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0053">
                <description>Ytterligare information om åtgärden, eventuellt specifikt för ett särskilt vårdsteg.</description>
                <text>Övrig information</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0085">
                <description>Plats för att infoga tilläggsinformation som krävs för lokala anpassningar eller anpassning till andra referensmodeller eller formella krav.</description>
                <text>Tilläggsinformation</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0103">
                <description>Unik identifikator för läkemedelsbeställningen.</description>
                <text>Beställnings-ID</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0104">
                <description>Information om läkemedlet inklusive dess styrka, form och beståndsdelar.</description>
                <text>Läkemedelsinformation</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0106">
                <description>Den ursprungliga läkemedelsorden har godkänts på nytt för att möjliggöra fortsatt dosering. I vissa jurisdiktioner måste en helt ny order utfärdas.</description>
                <text>Förnyelse av receptbeläggning</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0109">
                <description>Rekommenderat läkemedel, ej påbörjad ordination.</description>
                <text>Rekommenderat läkemedel</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0131">
                <description>Kvantitet av läkemedelsartikeln.</description>
                <text>Kvantitet</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0132">
                <description>Substitutionsåtgärder vidtagna av den person som administrerar eller dispenserar läkemedlet.</description>
                <text>Substitution</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0133">
                <description>Anledning eller motivering till den vidtagna substitutionsåtgärden.</description>
                <text>Orsak för substitution</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0138">
                <description>Ersättning av läkemedel som är bioekvivalent med det som beställts.</description>
                <text>Utförd substitution</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0139">
                <description>Trots tillåtelse av läkemedelsordern, ersattes inte ett bioekvivalent läkemedel.</description>
                <text>Ej utförd substitution</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0140">
                <description>Information om atomisk lokalisering och administrering av läkemedlet.</description>
                <text>Administreringsinformation</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0141">
                <description>Beskrivning av administrationsstället för den beställda artikeln.</description>
                <text>Anatomisk lokalisering</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0142">
                <description>Närmare beskrivning av administrationsstället för läkemedlet, vaccinet eller annan terapeutisk produkt.</description>
                <text>Exakt anatomisk lokalisering</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0143">
                <description>Den teknik eller utrustning med vilken den beställda artikeln administrerades eller ska administreras.</description>
                <text>Administreringsmetod</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0144">
                <description>Information om den medicinska utrustning som används vid administrering av läkemedlet.</description>
                <text>Utrustning för administrering</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0145">
                <description>Förslag på ordination har utarbetats och inväntar bekräftelse från en auktoriserad läkare. Kan användas där återauktorisering utförs som en batch. Detta flödessteg kan ha statusen "planerad" eller "aktiv", vilket återspeglar behovet av att hantera nya beställningar såväl som återauktoriserade ordrar.</description>
                <text>Ordination som inväntar tillstånd</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0147">
                <description>Sättet genom vilken den beställda artikeln administrerades eller ska administreras i patientens kropp.</description>
                <text>Administreringsväg</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0148">
                <description>*The medication has been physically prepared. (en)</description>
                <text>Förberedelse av läkemedel</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0149">
                <description>Vårdsteget har dubbelkontrollerats av annan individ.</description>
                <text>Dubbelkontrollerat?</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0150">
                <description>Ordinationen avbröts innan det utfärdades.</description>
                <text>Avbruten ordination</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0151">
                <description>Receptet har ogiltigförklarats eller upphört att gälla.</description>
                <text>Ogiltigt eller utgånget recept</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0152">
                <description>Receptet har framgångsrikt uppfyllts.</description>
                <text>Uppfyllt recept</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0153">
                <description>Läkemedlet har formellt godkänts för användning.</description>
                <text>Godkännande av läkemedel</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0154">
                <description>Datum/tid för omstart av läkemedelsbehandling, enligt "Indragen administrering".</description>
                <text>Datum/tid för omstart</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0155">
                <description>Kriteriet för omstart av läkemedelsbehandling, enligt "Indragen administrering".</description>
                <text>Omstartskriterium</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0156">
                <description>Klinisk orsak till läkemedelsbehandling.</description>
                <text>Klinisk indikation</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0157">
                <description>*The prepared medication has been double checked. (en)</description>
                <text>*Medication double checked (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0158">
                <description>*An administration of a dose of the medication was started but was subsequently aborted. (en)</description>
                <text>*Dose administration aborted (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>Aktiviteter relaterade till planering, schemaläggning, recepthantering, dosering, administrering, avbrott från eller användning av läkemedel, vaccinering, näringspreparat eller annan terapeutisk produkt.</description>
                <text>Hantering av läkemedelsregim</text>
            </items>
        </term_definitions>
        <term_definitions language="pt-br">
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>Qualquer atividade relacionada ao planejamento, agendamento, gestão da prescrição, dispensação, administração, término e outro uso de um medicamento, vacina, produto nutricional ou outro item terapêutico.</description>
                <text>Gestão de medicação</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0002">
                <description>Uma prescrição foi emitida para a medicação.</description>
                <text>Prescrição emitida</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0003">
                <description>Uma prescrição de medicação foi aviada, por exemplo de uma farmácia ao paciente.</description>
                <text>Prescrição aviada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0004">
                <description>A medicação foi adquirida, ou administrada, ao paciente pela primeira vez. Embora em algumas situações esta data significativa pode ser computada como a primeira de muitas administrações, em outras, como na atenção primária, datas de administração específicas não estão prontamente disponíveis. &#13;
</description>
                <text>Curso da medicação iniciado</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0005">
                <description>O item de medicação específico foi revisado, conforme planejado. Este não pretende capturar uma revisão da lista completa de medicação.</description>
                <text>Curso da medicação revisado</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0006">
                <description>Dose do medicamento foi administrada.</description>
                <text>Dose administrada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0007">
                <description>O tratamento medicamentoso foi finalizado conforme previsto.</description>
                <text>Final do tratamento medicamentoso</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0008">
                <description>A prescrição não foi aviada devido a um problema técnico ou de suprimento farmacêutico.</description>
                <text>Suprimento da prescrição atrasado</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0009">
                <description>A administração do medicamento foi suspensa até nova ordem. Doses adicionais não devem ser administradas até que a data de reinício ou condições forem alcançadas. Na configuração de nova data/condições para reinício após a suspensão, deve-se realizar a etapa de suspensão de Administrações suspensas e voltar a Data do início/ Condição de início.</description>
                <text>Administração suspensa</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0010">
                <description>Nova liberação de prescrição já existente.</description>
                <text>Nova liberação de prescrição</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0011">
                <description>Reemissão da prescrição não está disponível sem alguma intervenção.</description>
                <text>Reemissão da prescrição suspensa</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0012">
                <description>O curso planejado da medicação foi cancelado antes de qualquer administração.</description>
                <text>Curso da medicação cancelado</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0013">
                <description>O curso planejado da medicação foi adiado antes de qualquer administração.</description>
                <text>Curso da medicação adiado</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0015">
                <description>A administração desta medicação foi interrompida após administração da primeira dose, mas antes de completar o curso pretendido.</description>
                <text>Curso da medicação interrompido</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0016">
                <description>A hora de começar a medicação, ou outra condição para iniciar o tratamento foi estabelecida.</description>
                <text>Data do início/ Condição de início</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0017">
                <description>@ internal @</description>
                <text>Tree</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0018">
                <description>A administração de um medicamento foi suspensa e não realizada. Não há expectativa de que será dada mais tarde, embora a próxima dose (se houver) deva ser administrada conforme a prescrição original.</description>
                <text>Omissão da administração da dose</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0020">
                <description>Nome do medicamento, vacina ou outro item terapêutico que foi o foco da atividade.</description>
                <text>Item de medicação</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0021">
                <description>Motivo pelo qual a etapa para determinada medicação foi realizada.</description>
                <text>Motivo</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0024">
                <description>Narrativa adicional sobre a atividade ou etapa do fluxo de cuidado não capturada em outros campos, incluindo detalhes de quaisquer variáveis entre a ação pretendida e a ação realmente realizada.</description>
                <text>Comentário</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0025">
                <description>O número sequencial específico da atividade registrada.</description>
                <text>Número sequencial</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0030">
                <description>@ internal @</description>
                <text>Tree</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0033">
                <description>Quaisquer orientações, instruções ou conselhos dados ao sujeito do cuidado ou cuidador no momento</description>
                <text>Orientação ao paciente</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0039">
                <description>Foi necessário realizar uma alteração significativa na prescrição, resultando no cancelamento da atual e a substituição por uma nova prescrição.</description>
                <text>Alteração significativa na prescrição</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0041">
                <description>A prescrição foi alterada de uma forma que não exige uma nova liberação da prescrição, de acordo com as regras clínicas locais.</description>
                <text>Prescrição com mínimas mudanças</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0043">
                <description>Data/hora na qual a foi agendada ação da medicação.</description>
                <text>Data/hora original do agendamento</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0044">
                <description>A administração de uma dose de medicamento foi adiada, mas espera-se que seja administrada o mais rápido possível.</description>
                <text>Administração da dose adiada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0053">
                <description>Demais detalhes estruturados da ação, possivelmente específicos à etapa do processo.</description>
                <text>Detalhes adicionais</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0085">
                <description>Informações adicionais necessárias para capturar o conteúdo local ou para se alinhar com outros modelos de referência / formalismos.</description>
                <text>Extensão</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0103">
                <description>Identificador único para a solicitação de medicação.</description>
                <text>Identificação da solicitação</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0104">
                <description>Detalhes estruturados sobre a medicação incluindo concentração, forma e componentes.</description>
                <text>Detalhes da medicação</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0106">
                <description>A solicitação original da medicação foi reautorização para permitir prescrição ou dispensação repetida. Em algumas jurisdições uma nova solicitação deve ser emitida nestas circunstâncias.</description>
                <text>Prescrição reautorizada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0109">
                <description>Medicamento foi recomendado mas nenhuma ação foi realizada para iniciar a prescrição.</description>
                <text>Medicamento recomendado</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0131">
                <description>Detalhes específicos sobre a quantidade do item de medicação.</description>
                <text>Quantidade</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0132">
                <description>Ação de substituição realizada pela pessoa que administrou ou dispensou o medicamento.</description>
                <text>Substituição</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0133">
                <description>O motivo ou justificativa para a ação de substituição realizada.</description>
                <text>Motivo da substituição</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0138">
                <description>A medicação substituída é bioequivalente àquela prescrita.</description>
                <text>Substituição realizada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0139">
                <description>Embora permitido pela prescrição da medicação a substituição por um medicamento bioequivalente não foi realizada.</description>
                <text>Substituição não realizada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0140">
                <description>Detalhes do local do corpo e administração da medicação.</description>
                <text>Detalhes da administração</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0141">
                <description>Descrição estruturada do local de administração do item prescrito.</description>
                <text>Local do corpo</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0142">
                <description>Descrição estruturada do local de administração do medicamento, vacina ou insumo terapêutico.</description>
                <text>Local do corpo estruturado</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0143">
                <description>A técnica ou dispositivo pelo qual o item foi, ou deve ser, administrado.</description>
                <text>Método de administração</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0144">
                <description>Detalhes do dispositivo médico usado para auxiliar a administração do medicamento.</description>
                <text>Dispositivo de administração</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0145">
                <description>Rascunho da prescrição foi preparado e está aguardando confirmação de um clínico autorizado. Pode ser usado quando reautorizações são realizadas em lote. Esta etapa do processo de cuidado pode ter um estado de "planejado" ou "ativo", refletindo a necessidade de gerir novas solicitações assim como solicitações reautorizadas.</description>
                <text>Prescrição no aguardo de autorização</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0147">
                <description>A via pela qual o item prescrito foi, ou deve ser, administrado no corpo do indivíduo.</description>
                <text>Via</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0148">
                <description>*The medication has been physically prepared. (en)</description>
                <text>Medicamento preparado</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0149">
                <description>Uma ação que foi checada por outro indivíduo.</description>
                <text>Dupla checagem?</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0150">
                <description>A prescrição foi cancelada antes de ser emitida.</description>
                <text>Prescrição cancelada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0151">
                <description>A prescrição foi invalidada ou expirou sem ser aviada.</description>
                <text>Prescrição inválida ou cancelada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0152">
                <description>A prescrição foi aviada com sucesso.</description>
                <text>Prescrição aviada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0153">
                <description>A medicação foi formalmente autorizada para uso.</description>
                <text>Medicação autorizada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0154">
                <description>A data/hora na qual o curso da medicação está configurado para reiniciar, como a etapa "Conjunto de condições para reinício da medicação" do processo.</description>
                <text>Data/hora do reinício</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0155">
                <description>O critério que desencadeia o reinício do curso da medicação, como uma etapa "Conjunto de condições para reinício da medicação" do processo.</description>
                <text>Critério do reinício</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0156">
                <description>*The clinical reason for the medication activity. (en)</description>
                <text>*Clinical indication (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0157">
                <description>*The prepared medication has been double checked. (en)</description>
                <text>*Medication double checked (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0158">
                <description>*An administration of a dose of the medication was started but was subsequently aborted. (en)</description>
                <text>*Dose administration aborted (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>Qualquer atividade relacionada ao planejamento, agendamento, gestão da prescrição, dispensação, administração, término e outro uso de um medicamento, vacina, produto nutricional ou outro item terapêutico.</description>
                <text>Gestão de medicação</text>
            </items>
        </term_definitions>
        <term_definitions language="en">
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>Any activity related to the planning, scheduling, prescription management, dispensing, administration, cessation and other use of a medication, vaccine, nutritional product or other therapeutic item.</description>
                <text>Medication management</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0002">
                <description>A prescription has been issued for the medication.</description>
                <text>Prescription issued</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0003">
                <description>The ordered medication has been dispensed, for example from a pharmacy to the patient.</description>
                <text>Prescription dispensed</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0004">
                <description>The medication has been taken by, or administered to, the patient for the first time. Although in some settings this significant date may be computable as the first of several administrations, in other settings, such as primary care, specific administration dates are not readily available.</description>
                <text>Medication course commenced</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0005">
                <description>The individual medication has been reassessed, for example whether the medication should still be taken. This is not intended to capture review of the medication list.</description>
                <text>Medication reassessed</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0006">
                <description>A single administration of the medication has taken place.</description>
                <text>Dose administered</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0007">
                <description>The medication course has been completed as planned.</description>
                <text>Medication course completed</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0008">
                <description>The prescription has not been dispensed due to a technical or pharamaceutical supply issue.</description>
                <text>Prescription supply delayed</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0009">
                <description>The administration of the medication has been suspended until further notice. No further doses should be given until the restart date or conditions have been met. When setting the date/conditions for restart after suspending, a step from ‘Administrations suspended’ and back to 'Medication start date/condition set' should be performed.</description>
                <text>Administrations suspended</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0010">
                <description>A prescription has been re-issued for an existing medication order.</description>
                <text>Prescription re-issued</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0011">
                <description>Issue of the prescription is awaiting re-authorisation by a clinician.</description>
                <text>Prescription re-authorisation pending</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0012">
                <description>The planned course of medication has been cancelled prior to any administration.</description>
                <text>Medication course cancelled</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0013">
                <description>The scheduled medication course has been postponed prior to any administration.</description>
                <text>Medication course postponed</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0015">
                <description>Administration of the medication has been ceased during the period of the intended course.</description>
                <text>Medication course stopped</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0016">
                <description>The time to start the medication, or other starting condition, has been set.</description>
                <text>Medication start date/condition set</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0017">
                <description>@ internal @</description>
                <text>Tree</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0018">
                <description>An administration of the medication has been withheld and not given. There is no expectation that it will be given later, though the next dose (if any) should be administered according to the original order.</description>
                <text>Dose administration omitted</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0020">
                <description>Name of the medication, vaccine or other therapeutic/prescribable item which was the focus of the activity.</description>
                <text>Medication item</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0021">
                <description>Reason that the pathway step for the identified medication was carried out.</description>
                <text>Reason</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0024">
                <description>Additional narrative about the activity or pathway step not captured in other fields, including details of any variance between the intended action and the action actually performed.</description>
                <text>Comment</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0025">
                <description>The sequence number specific to the pathway step being recorded.</description>
                <text>Sequence number</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0030">
                <description>@ internal @</description>
                <text>Tree</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0033">
                <description>Any guidance, instructions or advice given to the subject of care or personal carer at the time of the pathway step.</description>
                <text>Patient guidance</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0039">
                <description>A major change to the order was required, resulting in this order being stopped and a replacement order being started.</description>
                <text>Major change to order</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0041">
                <description>The medication order has been changed in a manner which does not require a new instruction/order to be issued, according to local clinical rules.</description>
                <text>Minor change to order</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0043">
                <description>The datetime at which the medication action was scheduled to occur.</description>
                <text>Original scheduled date/time</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0044">
                <description>An administration of a dose of the medication has been delayed but is expected to be given as soon as possible.</description>
                <text>Dose administration deferred</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0053">
                <description>Further structured details of the action, possibly specific to a pathway step.</description>
                <text>Additional details</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0085">
                <description>Additional information required to capture local content or to align with other reference models/formalisms.</description>
                <text>Extension</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0103">
                <description>Unique identifier for the medication order.</description>
                <text>Order ID</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0104">
                <description>Structured details about the medication including strength, form and constituent substances.</description>
                <text>Medication details</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0106">
                <description>The original medication order has been re-authorised to allow repeat prescription or dispensing. In some jurisdictions an entirely new order must be issued in these circumstances.</description>
                <text>Prescription re-authorised</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0109">
                <description>The medication has been recommended but no steps have been taken to initiate prescribing.</description>
                <text>Medication recommended</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0131">
                <description>Specific details about the amount of the medication item.</description>
                <text>Amount</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0132">
                <description>Subsitution action taken by the person administering or dispensing the drug.</description>
                <text>Substitution</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0133">
                <description>The reason or justification for the substitution action taken.</description>
                <text>Substitution reason</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0138">
                <description>A medication was substituted which is bioequivalent to that ordered.</description>
                <text>Substitution performed</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0139">
                <description>Although allowed by the medication order a bioequvalent medication was not substituted.</description>
                <text>Substitution not performed</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0140">
                <description>Details of body site and administration of the medication.</description>
                <text>Administration details</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0141">
                <description>Structured description of the site of administration of the ordered item.</description>
                <text>Body site</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0142">
                <description>Structured description of the site of administration of the medication, vaccine or therapeutic good.</description>
                <text>Structured body site</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0143">
                <description>The technique or device by which the ordered item was, or is to be, administered.</description>
                <text>Administration method</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0144">
                <description>Details of the medical device used to assist administration of the medication.</description>
                <text>Administration device</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0145">
                <description>Draft prescription has been prepared and is awaiting confirmation from an authorised clinician. May be used where reauthorisations are performed as a batch. This careflow_step may have a status of 'planned' or 'active', reflecting the need to to handle new orders as well as re-authorised orders.</description>
                <text>Prescription awaiting authorisation</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0147">
                <description>The route by which the ordered item was, or is to be, administered into the subject's body.</description>
                <text>Route</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0148">
                <description>The medication has been physically prepared.</description>
                <text>Medication prepared</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0149">
                <description>The pathway step has been checked by a separate individual.</description>
                <text>Double-checked?</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0150">
                <description>The prescription was cancelled prior to being issued.</description>
                <text>Prescription cancelled</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0151">
                <description>Prescription has been invalidated or has expired without being fulfilled.</description>
                <text>Prescription invalid or expired</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0152">
                <description>The prescription has been fulfilled successfully.</description>
                <text>Prescription fulfilled</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0153">
                <description>The medication has been formally authorised for use.</description>
                <text>Medication authorised</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0154">
                <description>The date/time on which the medication course is set to restart, as per the "Administrations suspended" pathway step.</description>
                <text>Restart date/time</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0155">
                <description>The criterion which triggers the medication course to restart, as per the "Administrations suspended" pathway step.</description>
                <text>Restart criterion</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0156">
                <description>The clinical reason for the medication activity.</description>
                <text>Clinical indication</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0157">
                <description>The prepared medication has been double checked.</description>
                <text>Medication double checked</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0158">
                <description>An administration of a dose of the medication was started but was subsequently aborted.</description>
                <text>Dose administration aborted</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>Any activity related to the planning, scheduling, prescription management, dispensing, administration, cessation and other use of a medication, vaccine, nutritional product or other therapeutic item.</description>
                <text>Medication management</text>
            </items>
        </term_definitions>
        <term_definitions language="ar-sy">
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>*Any activity related to the planning, scheduling, prescription management, dispensing, administration, cessation and other use of a medication, vaccine, nutritional product or other therapeutic item.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication management(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0002">
                <description>*A prescription has been issued for the medication.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription issued(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0003">
                <description>*The ordered medication has been dispensed, for example from a pharmacy to the patient.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription dispensed(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0004">
                <description>*The medication has been taken by, or administered to, the patient for the first time. Although in some settings this significant date may be computable as the first of several administrations, in other settings, such as primary care, specific administration dates are not readily available.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication course commenced(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0005">
                <description>*The specific medication item has been reviewed, as planned. This is not intended to capture review of the whole medication list.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication course reviewed(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0006">
                <description>*A single administration of the medication has taken place.(en)</description>
                <text>*Dose administered(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0007">
                <description>*The medication course has been completed as planned.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication course completed(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0008">
                <description>*The prescription has not been dispensed due to a technical or pharamaceutical supply issue.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription supply delayed(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0009">
                <description>*The administration of the medication has been suspended until further notice. No further doses should be given until the restart date or conditions have been met. When setting the date/conditions for restart after suspending, a step from ‘Administrations suspended’ and back to 'Medication start date/condition set' should be performed.(en)</description>
                <text>*Administrations suspended(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0010">
                <description>*A prescription token has been re-issued for an existing medication order.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription re-issued(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0011">
                <description>*Reissuing of this prescription is not available without some intervention.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription re-issue suspended(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0012">
                <description>*The planned course of medication has been cancelled prior to any administration.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication course cancelled(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0013">
                <description>*The scheduled medication course has been postponed prior to any administration.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication course postponed(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0015">
                <description>*The administration of this medication has been ceased after the first dose has been administered, but before intended completion of the course.  (en)</description>
                <text>*Medication course stopped(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0016">
                <description>*The time to start this medication, or other starting condition, has been set.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication start date/condition set(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0017">
                <description>*@ internal @(en)</description>
                <text>*Tree(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0018">
                <description>*The administration of a medication has been withheld and not given. There is no expectation that it will be given later, though the next dose (if any) should be administered according to the original order.(en)</description>
                <text>*Dose administration omitted(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0020">
                <description>*Name of the medication, vaccine or other therapeutic/prescribable item which was the focus of the activity.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication item(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0021">
                <description>*Reason that the pathway step for the identified medication was carried out.(en)</description>
                <text>*Reason(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0024">
                <description>*Additional narrative about the activity or care pathway step not captured in other fields, including details of any variance between the intended action and the action actually performed.(en)</description>
                <text>*Comment(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0025">
                <description>*The sequence number specific to the activity being recorded.(en)</description>
                <text>*Sequence number(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0030">
                <description>*@ internal @(en)</description>
                <text>*Tree(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0033">
                <description>*Any guidance, instructions or advice given to the subject of care or personal carer at the time of the pathway step.(en)</description>
                <text>*Patient guidance(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0039">
                <description>*A major change to the order was required, resulting in this order being stopped and a replacement order being started.(en)</description>
                <text>*Major change to order.(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0041">
                <description>*The medication order has been changed in a manner which does not require a new instruction/order to be issued, according to local clinical rules.(en)</description>
                <text>*Minor change to order(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0043">
                <description>*The datetime at which the medication action was scheduled to occur.(en)</description>
                <text>*Original scheduled date/time(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0044">
                <description>*Administration of a dose of mediciation has been delayed but is expected to be given as soon as possible.(en)</description>
                <text>*Dose administration deferred(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0053">
                <description>*Further structured details of the action, possibly specific to a pathway step.(en)</description>
                <text>*Additional details(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0085">
                <description>**(en)</description>
                <text>*Cluster(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0103">
                <description>*Unique identifier for the medication order.(en)</description>
                <text>*Order ID(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0104">
                <description>*Structured details about the medication including strength, form and constituent substances.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication details(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0106">
                <description>*The original medication order has been re-authorised to allow repeat prescription or dispensing. In some jurisdictions an entirely new order must be issued in these circumstances.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription re-authorised(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0109">
                <description>*The medication has been recommended but no steps have been taken to initiate prescribing.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication recommended(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0131">
                <description>*Specific details about the amount of the medication item.(en)</description>
                <text>*Amount(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0132">
                <description>*Subsitution action taken by the person administering or dispensing the drug.(en)</description>
                <text>*Substitution(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0133">
                <description>*The reason or justification for the substitution action taken.(en)</description>
                <text>*Substitution reason(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0138">
                <description>*A medication was substituted which is bioequivalent to that ordered.(en)</description>
                <text>*Substitution performed(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0139">
                <description>*Although allowed by the medication order a bioequvalent medication was not substituted.(en)</description>
                <text>*Substitution not performed(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0140">
                <description>*Details of body site and administration of the medication.(en)</description>
                <text>*Administration details(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0141">
                <description>*Structured description of the site of administration of the ordered item.(en)</description>
                <text>*Body site(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0142">
                <description>*Structured description of the site of administration of the medication, vaccine or therapeutic good.(en)</description>
                <text>*Structured body site(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0143">
                <description>*The technique or device by which the ordered item was, or is to be, administered.(en)</description>
                <text>*Administration method(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0144">
                <description>*Details of the medical device used to assist administration of the medication.(en)</description>
                <text>*Administration device(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0145">
                <description>*Draft prescription has been prepared and is awaiting confirmation from an authorised clinician. May be used where reauthorisations are performed as a batch. This careflow_step may have a status of 'planned' or 'active', reflecting the need to to handle new orders as well as re-authorised orders.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription awaiting authorisation(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0147">
                <description>*The route by which the ordered item was, or is to be, administered into the subject's body.(en)</description>
                <text>*Route(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0148">
                <description>*The medication has been physically prepared. (en)</description>
                <text>*Medication prepared(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0149">
                <description>*The action step has been checked by a separate individual.(en)</description>
                <text>*Double-checked?(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0150">
                <description>*The prescription was cancelled prior to being issued.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription cancelled(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0151">
                <description>*Prescription has been invalidated or has expired without being fulfilled.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription invalid or expired(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0152">
                <description>*The prescription has been fulfilled successfully.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription fulfilled(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0153">
                <description>*The medication has been formally authorised for use.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication authorised(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0154">
                <description>*The date/time on which the medication course is set to restart, as per the "Medication restart date/condition set" pathway step.(en)</description>
                <text>*Restart date/time(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0155">
                <description>*The criterion which triggers the medication course to restart, as per the "Medication restart date/condition set" pathway step.(en)</description>
                <text>*Restart criterion(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0156">
                <description>*The clinical reason for the medication activity. (en)</description>
                <text>*Clinical indication (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0157">
                <description>*The prepared medication has been double checked. (en)</description>
                <text>*Medication double checked (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0158">
                <description>*An administration of a dose of the medication was started but was subsequently aborted. (en)</description>
                <text>*Dose administration aborted (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>*Any activity related to the planning, scheduling, prescription management, dispensing, administration, cessation and other use of a medication, vaccine, nutritional product or other therapeutic item.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication management(en)</text>
            </items>
        </term_definitions>
        <term_definitions language="zh-cn">
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>任何与药物、疫苗、营养产品/制品或其他治疗类制剂（therapeutic item）的计划[编制]、排程/安排、处方管理、配发、施用/给药、停止/停用和其他使用情况相关的活动。又称为用药管理。</description>
                <text>药物管理</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0002">
                <description>已经签发/开出了相应药物的处方。</description>
                <text>已签发的处方</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0003">
                <description>已经配发医嘱所开立的药物；例如，由药房配发给了相应的患者。</description>
                <text>已配发的处方</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0004">
                <description>患者已经首次服用相应的药物，或者说已经对其进行了首次的施用/给药。 尽管在某些场所环境下，这一重要的日期可以作为多次施用/给药之中的第一次而用于计算，而在其他的场所环境下，如初级照护服务（基层医疗服务），具体的施用/给药日期并不容易获得。</description>
                <text>已开始的药物治疗过程</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0005">
                <description>已经重新评估了相应的具体药物，如是否仍然应当服用该药物。 这一节点并非旨在用于采集药物清单的审核情况。</description>
                <text>已重新评估的药物</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0006">
                <description>已经进行了单独一次的药物施用/给药。</description>
                <text>已施用/给药的剂量</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0007">
                <description>已经按计划完成了相应的药物治疗过程。</description>
                <text>已完成的药物治疗过程</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0008">
                <description>由于技术或药品供应问题，目前尚未配发相应的处方[药物]。</description>
                <text>已延迟的处方供应</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0009">
                <description>已经暂停了相应药物的施用/给药，直至另行通知。 在重新开始日期之前或满足种种条件之前，不应再进行给予更多的剂量药物。 在设置暂停之后的重新开始日期/条件时，应当执行从“已暂停的施用/给药”（Administrations suspended）返回到“已设定的用药开始日期/条件”（Medication start date/condition set）的步骤。</description>
                <text>已暂停的施用/给药</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0010">
                <description>已经为现有的药物医嘱重新签发/开出了相应的处方。</description>
                <text>已重新签发的处方</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0011">
                <description>处方的签发正在等待临床医务人员的重新授权。</description>
                <text>待处理的处方重新授权</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0012">
                <description>在任何的施用/给药之前，已经取消了已计划的药物治疗过程。</description>
                <text>已取消的药物治疗过程</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0013">
                <description>在任何的施用/给药之前，已经推迟了已排程/安排的药物治疗过程。</description>
                <text>已推迟的药物治疗过程</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0015">
                <description>在预定的治疗过程（疗程）期间，已经停止了相应药物的施用/给药。</description>
                <text>已停止的药物治疗过程</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0016">
                <description>已经设定开始用药的时间或其他的起始/开始条件。</description>
                <text>已设定的用药开始日期/条件</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0017">
                <description>@ internal @</description>
                <text>Tree</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0018">
                <description>已经予以省略/扣除而并未给予的施用/给药。 虽说应该按照原始的医嘱来施用/给予下次剂量的药物（如果有的话），但并不期望后续会再施用/给予所省略/扣除的剂量。</description>
                <text>已省略的剂量管理</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0020">
                <description>作为活动关注焦点的药物、疫苗或其他治疗项/处方项的名称。</description>
                <text>用药项</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0021">
                <description>关于执行所标识用药/药物治疗路径步骤的原因。</description>
                <text>原因</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0024">
                <description>额外关于其他字段之中并未采集的，关于相应活动或路径步骤的文本叙述型说明，包括关于预期行动与实际所执行的行动之间的任何差异的详情。</description>
                <text>备注</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0025">
                <description>专门针对当前所记录的路径步骤的顺序编号/序列号/序号。</description>
                <text>顺序编号</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0030">
                <description>@ internal @</description>
                <text>Tree</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0033">
                <description>为照护服务对象（患者）或具体照护人员所提供的任何关于特定路径步骤时的指导[意见]、操作指南/使用说明/指示或建议/忠告。</description>
                <text>患者指导</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0039">
                <description>需要对医嘱进行重大变更，导致该医嘱遭到停止并开始启用替代的医嘱。</description>
                <text>医嘱的重大变更</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0041">
                <description>根据本地的临床规则，采取并不需要签发新的指令/医嘱的方式，对药物医嘱进行了变更。</description>
                <text>医嘱的微小变更</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0043">
                <description>当初所排程/安排的开展药物治疗行动的日期时间。</description>
                <text>原始排程/安排的日期/时间</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0044">
                <description>已经推迟一剂药物的施用/给药，但预计会尽快施用/给药。</description>
                <text>已延期的施用/给药</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0053">
                <description>进一步关于当前行动的结构化细节，且有可能针对的是特定的路径步骤。</description>
                <text>其他详情</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0085">
                <description>采集本地语境/上下文背景或者是与其他的参考模型/形式化体系进行协调统一时所需的其他信息。</description>
                <text>扩展</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0103">
                <description>药物/用药医嘱的唯一性标识符。</description>
                <text>医嘱标识符</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0104">
                <description>关于相应药物的结构化详情，包括规格、剂型/形式和组成物质。</description>
                <text>药物详情</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0106">
                <description>已经对原始的药物医嘱进行了重新授权，以便能够重复利用处方或配发药物。在某些司法管辖区域，在此类的情况下，必须签发/开出全新的医嘱。</description>
                <text>已重新授权的处方</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0109">
                <description>已经推荐了相应的药物，但尚未采取任何的措施/步骤来启动处方开立的过程。</description>
                <text>已推荐的药物</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0131">
                <description>关于用药项数量的具体详情。</description>
                <text>数量</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0132">
                <description>负责施用/给药或配发药物的人员所采取的替换行动。</description>
                <text>替换</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0133">
                <description>关于所采取的替代行动的原因或理由。</description>
                <text>替换原因</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0138">
                <description>已经将医嘱所开立的药物替换成了与之生物等效的药物。</description>
                <text>已执行的替换</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0139">
                <description>尽管药物医嘱允许替换，但并未将医嘱所开立的药物替换成生物等效药物。</description>
                <text>未执行的替换</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0140">
                <description>关于当前药物治疗的身体部位和施用/给药情况的详情。</description>
                <text>施用/给药详情</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0141">
                <description>关于医嘱所开立用药项的施用/给药部位的结构化描述。</description>
                <text>身体部位</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0142">
                <description>关于药物、疫苗或治疗类产品施用/给药部位的结构化描述。</description>
                <text>结构化身体部位</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0143">
                <description>已经或预定施用医嘱所开立的用药项时所采用的技术方法或装置/器械/设备。</description>
                <text>施用/给药方法</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0144">
                <description>关于用来协助施用/给药的医疗装置/器械/设备的详情。</description>
                <text>施用/给药装置</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0145">
                <description>已经准备/书写好了处方草稿，正在等待授权临床医务人员的确认。可以用于批量执行重新授权的情况。照护服务流程步骤（careflow_step）的状态可能是“已计划”或“有效”，反映的则是需要处理新的医嘱以及重新授权的医嘱。</description>
                <text>等待授权的处方</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0147">
                <description>已经或预定将医嘱所开立的用药项施用于服务对象身体时所采用的途径。又称为施用途径或用药途径。</description>
                <text>途径</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0148">
                <description>已经实际上/物质上准备/制备好了相应的药物。</description>
                <text>已准备好的药物</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0149">
                <description>另一不同的人员已经检查核对了这一路径步骤。</description>
                <text>复核情况</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0150">
                <description>在签发/开出之前取消了处方。</description>
                <text>已取消的处方</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0151">
                <description>处方已经失效或过期且并未获得执行。</description>
                <text>无效或过期的处方</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0152">
                <description>已经成功地执行了相应的处方。</description>
                <text>已执行的处方</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0153">
                <description>已经正式授权使用相应的药物。</description>
                <text>已授权的药物</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0154">
                <description>根据“已暂停的施用/给药”（Administrations suspended）路径步骤，设置重新开始药物治疗过程的日期/时间。</description>
                <text>重新开始日期/时间</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0155">
                <description>根据“已暂停的施用/给药”（Administrations suspended）路径步骤，用于触发药物治疗过程重新开始的评判准则/标准。</description>
                <text>重新开始的评判准则</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0156">
                <description>用药活性的临床原因。</description>
                <text>临床适应证</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0157">
                <description>已经复核了所准备/制备好的相应药物。</description>
                <text>已复核的药物</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0158">
                <description>*An administration of a dose of the medication was started but was subsequently aborted. (en)</description>
                <text>*Dose administration aborted (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>任何与药物、疫苗、营养产品/制品或其他治疗类制剂（therapeutic item）的计划[编制]、排程/安排、处方管理、配发、施用/给药、停止/停用和其他使用情况相关的活动。又称为用药管理。</description>
                <text>药物管理</text>
            </items>
        </term_definitions>
        <term_definitions language="es">
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>Cualquier actividad relacionada con la planificación, programación, gestión de prescripciones, dispensación, administración, cese y otro uso de un medicamento, vacuna, producto nutricional u otro elemento terapéutico.</description>
                <text>Gestión de la medicación</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0002">
                <description>Se ha emitido una receta médica para el medicamento.</description>
                <text>Prescripción emitida</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0003">
                <description>Se ha dispensado la medicación solicitada, por ejemplo, desde una farmacia al paciente.</description>
                <text>Prescripción dispensada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0004">
                <description>El paciente ha tomado o se le ha administrado el medicamento por primera vez. Aunque en algunos entornos esta fecha significativa puede ser calculada como la primera de varias administraciones, en otros contextos, como la atención primaria, las fechas específicas de administración no están fácilmente disponibles.</description>
                <text>Curso de medicación iniciado</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0005">
                <description>Se ha reevaluado la medicación individual, por ejemplo, si debe seguir tomándose. No se trata de revisar la lista de medicamentos.</description>
                <text>Medicación reevaluada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0006">
                <description>Se ha realizado una única administración del medicamento.</description>
                <text>Dosis administrada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0007">
                <description>El curso de medicación se ha completado según lo previsto.</description>
                <text>Curso de medicación completado</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0008">
                <description>La receta no se ha dispensado debido a un problema técnico o de suministro farmacéutico.</description>
                <text>Retraso en el suministro de prescripciones</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0009">
                <description>La administración del medicamento ha sido suspendida hasta nuevo aviso. No deben administrarse más dosis hasta que se haya restablecido la fecha de reinicio o se hayan cumplido las condiciones necesarias. Al establecer la fecha/condiciones de reinicio tras la suspensión, debe realizarse un paso desde 'Administración suspendida' y volver a 'Fecha de inicio de la medicación/condición establecida'.</description>
                <text>Administración suspendida</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0010">
                <description>Se ha vuelto a emitir una receta para una orden de medicación existente.</description>
                <text>Prescripción reexpedida</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0011">
                <description>La emisión de la receta médica está pendiente de reautorización por parte de un clínico.</description>
                <text>Reautorización de prescripción pendiente</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0012">
                <description>Se ha cancelado la medicación prevista antes de su administración.</description>
                <text>Curso de medicación cancelado</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0013">
                <description>Se ha pospuesto el curso de medicación programado antes de cualquier administración.</description>
                <text>Curso de medicación pospuesto</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0015">
                <description>Se ha interrumpido la administración del medicamento durante el período del curso previsto.</description>
                <text>Interrupción de la medicación</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0016">
                <description>Se ha establecido el momento para comenzar la medicación, o cualquier otra condición de inicio.</description>
                <text>Fecha de inicio de la medicación/condición establecida</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0017">
                <description>@ internal @</description>
                <text>Tree</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0018">
                <description>Se ha retenido y no administrado una dosis del medicamento. No se espera que se administre más tarde, aunque la siguiente dosis (si la hubiera) debe administrarse de acuerdo con la orden original.</description>
                <text>Administración de dosis omitida</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0020">
                <description>Nombre del medicamento, vacuna u otro elemento terapéutico/prescribible foco de la actividad.</description>
                <text>Medicamento</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0021">
                <description>Motivo por el que se llevó a cabo la fase de la ruta para el medicamento identificado.</description>
                <text>Motivo</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0024">
                <description>Información adicional sobre la actividad o fase del proceso no recogida en otros campos, incluidos los detalles de cualquier variación entre la acción prevista y la acción realmente realizada.</description>
                <text>Comentarios</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0025">
                <description>La secuencia numérica específica de la fase del proceso que se está registrando.</description>
                <text>Secuencia numérica</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0030">
                <description>@ internal @</description>
                <text>Tree</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0033">
                <description>Cualquier orientación, instrucción o consejo que se haya dado al sujeto de asistencia o al cuidador personal en el momento de la fase del proceso.</description>
                <text>Orientación al paciente</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0039">
                <description>Fue necesario introducir un cambio importante en la orden, lo que obligó a interrumpirlo e iniciar una orden de reemplazo.</description>
                <text>Cambio importante en la orden médica</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0041">
                <description>La orden de medicación se ha modificado de manera que no requiere emitir una nueva instrucción/orden, de acuerdo con las normas clínicas locales.</description>
                <text>Cambio menor en la orden</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0043">
                <description>La fecha en la que estaba programada la acción de medicación.</description>
                <text>Fecha/hora programada original</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0044">
                <description>Se ha retrasado la administración de una dosis del medicamento, pero se espera que se administre lo antes posible.</description>
                <text>Administración de dosis aplazada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0053">
                <description>Detalles más estructurados de la acción, posiblemente específicos de una etapa del proceso.</description>
                <text>Detalles adicionales</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0085">
                <description>Información adicional necesaria para registrar el contenido local o para alinearse con otros modelos/formalismos de referencia.</description>
                <text>Ampliación</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0103">
                <description>Identificador único de la orden de medicación.</description>
                <text>ID de la orden</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0104">
                <description>Detalles estructurados sobre el medicamento, incluida la concentración, la forma y las sustancias que lo componen.</description>
                <text>Detalles del medicamento</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0106">
                <description>La orden de medicación original ha sido reautorizada para permitir la repetición de la prescripción o dispensación. En algunas jurisdicciones, en estas circunstancias debe emitirse una orden completamente nueva.</description>
                <text>Prescripción reautorizada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0109">
                <description>La medicación ha sido recomendada, pero no se han tomado medidas para iniciar la prescripción.</description>
                <text>Medicación recomendada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0131">
                <description>Detalles específicos sobre la cantidad de medicamento.</description>
                <text>Cantidad</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0132">
                <description>Medidas de sustitución adoptadas por la persona que administra o dispensa el medicamento.</description>
                <text>Sustitución</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0133">
                <description>Motivo o justificación de la medida de sustitución adoptada.</description>
                <text>Motivo de la sustitución</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0138">
                <description>Se sustituyó por un medicamento bioequivalente al solicitado.</description>
                <text>Sustitución realizada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0139">
                <description>Aunque la orden de medicación lo permitía, no se sustituyó por un medicamento bioequivalente.</description>
                <text>Sustitución no realizada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0140">
                <description>Datos sobre la localización corporal y la administración de la medicación.</description>
                <text>Detalles de la administración</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0141">
                <description>Descripción estructurada del lugar de administración del producto solicitado.</description>
                <text>Zona corporal</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0142">
                <description>Descripción estructurada del lugar de administración del medicamento, vacuna o bien terapéutico.</description>
                <text>Zona corporal estructurada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0143">
                <description>La técnica o el dispositivo mediante el cual se administró o se administrará el artículo solicitado.</description>
                <text>Método de administración</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0144">
                <description>Detalles del dispositivo médico utilizado para ayudar a la administración de la medicación.</description>
                <text>Dispositivo de administración</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0145">
                <description>Se ha preparado una receta provisional y está pendiente de confirmación por parte de un clínico autorizado. Puede ser utilizada cuando se realicen reautorizaciones de forma conjunta. Este careflow_step puede tener un estado de "planificado" o "activo", reflejando la necesidad de manejar tanto órdenes nuevas como órdenes reautorizadas.</description>
                <text>Prescripción pendiente de autorización</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0147">
                <description>La vía por la que se ha administrado o se va a administrar el producto solicitado al cuerpo del sujeto.</description>
                <text>Vía de administración</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0148">
                <description>*The medication has been physically prepared. (en)</description>
                <text>Medicación preparada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0149">
                <description>La fase del proceso ha sido comprobada por otra persona.</description>
                <text>¿Doble comprobación?</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0150">
                <description>La receta fue anulada antes de ser emitida.</description>
                <text>Prescripción anulada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0151">
                <description>La receta ha sido invalidada o ha caducado sin ser cumplida.</description>
                <text>Prescripción no válida o caducada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0152">
                <description>La prescripción ha sido cumplida con éxito.</description>
                <text>Prescripción cumplida</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0153">
                <description>Se ha autorizado formalmente el uso del medicamento.</description>
                <text>Medicación autorizada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0154">
                <description>La fecha/hora en la que el curso de medicación está programado para reiniciarse, según la fase del proceso "Administración suspendida".</description>
                <text>Fecha/hora de reinicio</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0155">
                <description>El criterio que desencadena el reinicio del curso de medicación, según la fase del proceso "Administración suspendida".</description>
                <text>Criterio de reinicio</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0156">
                <description>Motivo clínico de la actividad medicamentosa.</description>
                <text>Indicación clínica</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0157">
                <description>*The prepared medication has been double checked. (en)</description>
                <text>*Medication double checked (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0158">
                <description>*An administration of a dose of the medication was started but was subsequently aborted. (en)</description>
                <text>*Dose administration aborted (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>Cualquier actividad relacionada con la planificación, programación, gestión de prescripciones, dispensación, administración, cese y otro uso de un medicamento, vacuna, producto nutricional u otro elemento terapéutico.</description>
                <text>Gestión de la medicación</text>
            </items>
        </term_definitions>
        <term_definitions language="es-ar">
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>*Any activity related to the planning, scheduling, prescription management, dispensing, administration, cessation and other use of a medication, vaccine, nutritional product or other therapeutic item.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication management(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0002">
                <description>*A prescription has been issued for the medication.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription issued(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0003">
                <description>*The ordered medication has been dispensed, for example from a pharmacy to the patient.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription dispensed(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0004">
                <description>*The medication has been taken by, or administered to, the patient for the first time. Although in some settings this significant date may be computable as the first of several administrations, in other settings, such as primary care, specific administration dates are not readily available.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication course commenced(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0005">
                <description>*The specific medication item has been reviewed, as planned. This is not intended to capture review of the whole medication list.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication course reviewed(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0006">
                <description>*A single administration of the medication has taken place.(en)</description>
                <text>*Dose administered(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0007">
                <description>*The medication course has been completed as planned.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication course completed(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0008">
                <description>*The prescription has not been dispensed due to a technical or pharamaceutical supply issue.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription supply delayed(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0009">
                <description>*The administration of the medication has been suspended until further notice. No further doses should be given until the restart date or conditions have been met. When setting the date/conditions for restart after suspending, a step from ‘Administrations suspended’ and back to 'Medication start date/condition set' should be performed.(en)</description>
                <text>*Administrations suspended(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0010">
                <description>*A prescription token has been re-issued for an existing medication order.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription re-issued(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0011">
                <description>*Reissuing of this prescription is not available without some intervention.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription re-issue suspended(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0012">
                <description>*The planned course of medication has been cancelled prior to any administration.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication course cancelled(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0013">
                <description>*The scheduled medication course has been postponed prior to any administration.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication course postponed(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0015">
                <description>*The administration of this medication has been ceased after the first dose has been administered, but before intended completion of the course.  (en)</description>
                <text>*Medication course stopped(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0016">
                <description>*The time to start this medication, or other starting condition, has been set.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication start date/condition set(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0017">
                <description>*@ internal @(en)</description>
                <text>*Tree(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0018">
                <description>*The administration of a medication has been withheld and not given. There is no expectation that it will be given later, though the next dose (if any) should be administered according to the original order.(en)</description>
                <text>*Dose administration omitted(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0020">
                <description>*Name of the medication, vaccine or other therapeutic/prescribable item which was the focus of the activity.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication item(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0021">
                <description>*Reason that the pathway step for the identified medication was carried out.(en)</description>
                <text>*Reason(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0024">
                <description>*Additional narrative about the activity or care pathway step not captured in other fields, including details of any variance between the intended action and the action actually performed.(en)</description>
                <text>*Comment(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0025">
                <description>*The sequence number specific to the activity being recorded.(en)</description>
                <text>*Sequence number(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0030">
                <description>*@ internal @(en)</description>
                <text>*Tree(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0033">
                <description>*Any guidance, instructions or advice given to the subject of care or personal carer at the time of the pathway step.(en)</description>
                <text>*Patient guidance(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0039">
                <description>*A major change to the order was required, resulting in this order being stopped and a replacement order being started.(en)</description>
                <text>*Major change to order.(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0041">
                <description>*The medication order has been changed in a manner which does not require a new instruction/order to be issued, according to local clinical rules.(en)</description>
                <text>*Minor change to order(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0043">
                <description>*The datetime at which the medication action was scheduled to occur.(en)</description>
                <text>*Original scheduled date/time(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0044">
                <description>*Administration of a dose of mediciation has been delayed but is expected to be given as soon as possible.(en)</description>
                <text>*Dose administration deferred(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0053">
                <description>*Further structured details of the action, possibly specific to a pathway step.(en)</description>
                <text>*Additional details(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0085">
                <description>**(en)</description>
                <text>*Cluster(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0103">
                <description>*Unique identifier for the medication order.(en)</description>
                <text>*Order ID(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0104">
                <description>*Structured details about the medication including strength, form and constituent substances.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication details(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0106">
                <description>*The original medication order has been re-authorised to allow repeat prescription or dispensing. In some jurisdictions an entirely new order must be issued in these circumstances.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription re-authorised(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0109">
                <description>*The medication has been recommended but no steps have been taken to initiate prescribing.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication recommended(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0131">
                <description>*Specific details about the amount of the medication item.(en)</description>
                <text>*Amount(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0132">
                <description>*Subsitution action taken by the person administering or dispensing the drug.(en)</description>
                <text>*Substitution(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0133">
                <description>*The reason or justification for the substitution action taken.(en)</description>
                <text>*Substitution reason(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0138">
                <description>*A medication was substituted which is bioequivalent to that ordered.(en)</description>
                <text>*Substitution performed(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0139">
                <description>*Although allowed by the medication order a bioequvalent medication was not substituted.(en)</description>
                <text>*Substitution not performed(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0140">
                <description>*Details of body site and administration of the medication.(en)</description>
                <text>*Administration details(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0141">
                <description>*Structured description of the site of administration of the ordered item.(en)</description>
                <text>*Body site(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0142">
                <description>*Structured description of the site of administration of the medication, vaccine or therapeutic good.(en)</description>
                <text>*Structured body site(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0143">
                <description>*The technique or device by which the ordered item was, or is to be, administered.(en)</description>
                <text>*Administration method(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0144">
                <description>*Details of the medical device used to assist administration of the medication.(en)</description>
                <text>*Administration device(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0145">
                <description>*Draft prescription has been prepared and is awaiting confirmation from an authorised clinician. May be used where reauthorisations are performed as a batch. This careflow_step may have a status of 'planned' or 'active', reflecting the need to to handle new orders as well as re-authorised orders.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription awaiting authorisation(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0147">
                <description>*The route by which the ordered item was, or is to be, administered into the subject's body.(en)</description>
                <text>*Route(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0148">
                <description>*The medication has been physically prepared. (en)</description>
                <text>*Medication prepared(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0149">
                <description>*The action step has been checked by a separate individual.(en)</description>
                <text>*Double-checked?(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0150">
                <description>*The prescription was cancelled prior to being issued.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription cancelled(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0151">
                <description>*Prescription has been invalidated or has expired without being fulfilled.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription invalid or expired(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0152">
                <description>*The prescription has been fulfilled successfully.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription fulfilled(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0153">
                <description>*The medication has been formally authorised for use.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication authorised(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0154">
                <description>*The date/time on which the medication course is set to restart, as per the "Medication restart date/condition set" pathway step.(en)</description>
                <text>*Restart date/time(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0155">
                <description>*The criterion which triggers the medication course to restart, as per the "Medication restart date/condition set" pathway step.(en)</description>
                <text>*Restart criterion(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0156">
                <description>*The clinical reason for the medication activity. (en)</description>
                <text>*Clinical indication (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0157">
                <description>*The prepared medication has been double checked. (en)</description>
                <text>*Medication double checked (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0158">
                <description>*An administration of a dose of the medication was started but was subsequently aborted. (en)</description>
                <text>*Dose administration aborted (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>*Any activity related to the planning, scheduling, prescription management, dispensing, administration, cessation and other use of a medication, vaccine, nutritional product or other therapeutic item.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication management(en)</text>
            </items>
        </term_definitions>
        <term_definitions language="nb">
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>Detaljer om enhver legemiddelrelatert oppgave som utføres fra et legemiddel er ordinert eller rekvirert til det er utdelt eller eventuelt kassert, for eksempel bestilling, istandgjøring, administrering, ekspedering eller seponering.</description>
                <text>Legemiddelhåndtering</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0002">
                <description>Det er utstedt en resept for legemiddelet.</description>
                <text>Resept utstedt</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0003">
                <description>Legemiddelet er utdelt, for eksempel fra et apotek til pasienten.</description>
                <text>Resept ekspedert</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0004">
                <description>Legemiddelet er inntatt av eller administrert til pasienten for første gang. Selv om dette i noen bruksområder som f.eks. sykehus kan utledes fra den første av en rekke administreringer, må det i andre bruksområder som f.eks. allmennpraksis spesifiseres spesifikt siden administreringer ikke dokumenteres på samme måte.</description>
                <text>Medisinering startet</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0005">
                <description>Legemiddelet er revurdert, for eksempel for hvorvidt det fortsatt skal tas. Dette er ikke ment å omfatte gjennomgang av en legemiddelliste.</description>
                <text>Legemiddel revurdert</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0006">
                <description>En enkelt administrering av legemiddelet er utført.</description>
                <text>Legemiddel administrert</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0007">
                <description>Medisineringen er fullført som ordinert.</description>
                <text>Medisinering fullført</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0008">
                <description>Legemiddelet er ikke utdelt fordi det ikke er på lager enda.</description>
                <text>Forsinket levering</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0009">
                <description>Administrering av legemiddelet er satt på vent inntil videre, ordinasjonen er "nullet". Ingen ytterligere doser gis før kriterium eller dato for å sette medisineringen i gang igjen er møtt. Når dato eller kriterium for å ny oppstart settes, bør det gjøres et 'suspend_step' tilbake til "Oppstartsdato satt".</description>
                <text>Administrering satt på vent</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0010">
                <description>Legemiddelet har fått en fornyet resept for den eksisterende ordineringen.</description>
                <text>Resept fornyet</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0011">
                <description>Utstedelse av resept avventer reautorisering av en kliniker. I noen myndighetsområder kan ikke resepter reautoriseres, og det må i disse tilfellene utstedes en helt ny resept.</description>
                <text>Reautorisering av resept satt på vent</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0012">
                <description>Den planlagte medisineringen er avbrutt før den første dosen er administrert.</description>
                <text>Planlagt medisinering avbrutt</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0013">
                <description>Den planlagte medisineringen er satt på vent før den første dosen er administrert.</description>
                <text>Planlagt medisinering satt på vent</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0015">
                <description>Legemiddelet er seponert etter at første dose er administrert, men før planlagt fullførelse av ordineringen.</description>
                <text>Legemiddel seponert</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0016">
                <description>Tidspunktet eller vilkår for å starte medisineringen er satt.</description>
                <text>Oppstartsdato satt</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0017">
                <description>@ internal @</description>
                <text>Tree</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0018">
                <description>En enkeltdose er holdt tilbake og ikke administrert ("nullet"). Det er ingen forventing om at den aktuelle dosen skal gis på et senere tidspunkt, men neste dose administreres i henhold til ordineringen.</description>
                <text>Enkeltdose ikke administrert</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0020">
                <description>Navnet på legemiddelet, vaksinen eller det medisinske forbruksmateriellet som var fokus for aktiviteten.</description>
                <text>Legemiddel</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0021">
                <description>Årsak til at det aktuelle prosesstrinnet ble utført.</description>
                <text>Årsak</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0024">
                <description>Ytterligere fritekstdetaljer om aktiviteten eller prosesstrinnet som ikke representeres i andre elementer, inkludert detaljer om varians mellom den planlagte handlingen og handlingen som faktisk ble utført.</description>
                <text>Kommentar</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0025">
                <description>Sekvensnummeret for den spesifikke handlingen som blir registrert.</description>
                <text>Sekvensnummer</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0030">
                <description>@ internal @</description>
                <text>Tree</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0033">
                <description>Enhver instruksjon som gis til pasienten eller en omsorgsperson når prosesstrinnet utføres.</description>
                <text>Pasientinstruksjoner</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0039">
                <description>Det er utført en større endring i ordineringen, denne ordineringen er stoppet og en ny ordinering er igangsatt.</description>
                <text>Omfattende endring av ordinering</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0041">
                <description>Legemiddelordineringen er endret på en slik måte at det etter lokale retningslinjer ikke er behov for en ny ordinering. For eksempel endring av produkt fra tabletter til kapsler.</description>
                <text>Mindre endring av ordinering</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0043">
                <description>Dato/tid for når legemiddelaktiviteten var planlagt å skulle skje.</description>
                <text>Opprinnelig planlagt tid</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0044">
                <description>Administrering av legemiddelet er utsatt/forsinket, men legemiddelet forventes administrert så raskt som mulig.</description>
                <text>Administrering utsatt</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0053">
                <description>Ytterligere strukturerte detaljer om handlingen, for eksempel spesifikk informasjon for det aktuelle prosesstrinnet.</description>
                <text>Ytterligere detaljer</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0085">
                <description>Ytterligere informasjon som er nødvendig for å sammenstille med andre referansemodeller/formalismer.</description>
                <text>Tilleggsinformasjon</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0103">
                <description>Identifikatoren for den opprinnelige ordineringen.</description>
                <text>OrdineringsID</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0104">
                <description>Strukturerte detaljer om legemiddelet, blant annet styrke, form og virkestoffene det består av.</description>
                <text>Legemiddeldetaljer</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0106">
                <description>En repeterende resept har blitt reautorisert. I noen myndighetsområder må det i disse tilfellene utstedes en helt ny resept.</description>
                <text>Resept reautorisert</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0109">
                <description>Medisineringen er anbefalt, men ordinering er ikke iverksatt.</description>
                <text>Anbefalt medisinering</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0131">
                <description>Spesifikke detaljer om mengden legemiddel.</description>
                <text>Mengde</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0132">
                <description>Generisk bytte utført ved administrering eller ekspedering.</description>
                <text>Generisk bytte</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0133">
                <description>Årsak eller begrunnelse for at generisk bytte er utført eller ikke utført.</description>
                <text>Årsak for bytte/ikke bytte</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0138">
                <description>Det ordinerte produktet ble byttet til et bioekvivalent produkt.</description>
                <text>Generisk bytte utført</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0139">
                <description>Det ordinerte produktet ble ikke byttet til et bioekvivalent produkt, til tross for at dette var tillatt i ordineringen.</description>
                <text>Generisk bytte ikke utført</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0140">
                <description>Detaljer om administrering av legemiddelet.</description>
                <text>Administreringsdetaljer</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0141">
                <description>Strukturert beskrivelse av hvor i kroppen det ordinerte produktet skal administreres eller ble administrert.</description>
                <text>Anatomisk lokalisering</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0142">
                <description>Strukturert beskrivelse av administreringsstedet for legemiddelet eller vaksinen.</description>
                <text>Strukturert anatomisk lokalisering</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0143">
                <description>Metoden legemiddelet ble administrert eller skal administreres ved.</description>
                <text>Administreringsmetode</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0144">
                <description>Detaljer om utstyret som ble brukt for å administrere legemiddelet.</description>
                <text>Administreringsutstyr</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0145">
                <description>Det er forberedt et utkast for en resept, og denne avventer godkjenning av en autorisert kliniker. Kan brukes der reseptutstedelse utføres satsvis. Dette prosesstrinnet kan brukes enten med status "planned" eller "active", for å underbygge behovet for å håndtere både nye og reautoriserte ordinasjoner.</description>
                <text>Resept avventer autorisering</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0147">
                <description>Administreringsveien som skal eller ble brukt for legemiddelet.</description>
                <text>Administreringsvei</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0148">
                <description>Legemiddelet er fysisk istandgjort</description>
                <text>Legemiddel istandgjort</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0149">
                <description>Prosesstrinnet har blitt kontrollert av en annen person enn den som primært utfører det.</description>
                <text>Dobbeltkontrollert?</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0150">
                <description>Resepten ble avbrutt før den ble utstedt.</description>
                <text>Resept avbrutt</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0151">
                <description>Resepten er ugyldiggjort eller har utgått før den er ferdig ekspedert.</description>
                <text>Resept ugyldig eller utgått</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0152">
                <description>Resepten er ferdig ekspedert.</description>
                <text>Resept ferdig ekspedert</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0153">
                <description>Legemiddelet er formelt autorisert for bruk.</description>
                <text>Legemiddel autorisert</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0154">
                <description>Datoen eller tidspunktet når medisineringen skal startes opp igjen, i sammenheng med prosesstrinnet "Vilkår satt for å sette medisineringen i gang igjen".</description>
                <text>Dato/tid for ny oppstart</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0155">
                <description>Kriterium for når medisineringen skal startes opp igjen, i sammenheng med prosesstrinnet "Vilkår satt for å sette medisineringen i gang igjen".</description>
                <text>Kriterium for ny oppstart</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0156">
                <description>Den kliniske årsaken til legemiddeladministrasjonen.</description>
                <text>Klinisk indikasjon</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0157">
                <description>Det istandgjorte legemiddelet har blitt dobbeltkontrollert.</description>
                <text>Legemiddel dobbeltkontrollert</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0158">
                <description>Administrering av en enkeltdose av legemiddelet ble påbegynt men deretter avbrutt.</description>
                <text>Administrering avbrutt</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>Detaljer om enhver legemiddelrelatert oppgave som utføres fra et legemiddel er ordinert eller rekvirert til det er utdelt eller eventuelt kassert, for eksempel bestilling, istandgjøring, administrering, ekspedering eller seponering.</description>
                <text>Legemiddelhåndtering</text>
            </items>
        </term_definitions>
        <term_definitions language="sl">
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>*Any activity related to the planning, scheduling, prescription management, dispensing, administration, cessation and other use of a medication, vaccine, nutritional product or other therapeutic item.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication management(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0002">
                <description>*A prescription has been issued for the medication.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription issued(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0003">
                <description>*The ordered medication has been dispensed, for example from a pharmacy to the patient.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription dispensed(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0004">
                <description>*The medication has been taken by, or administered to, the patient for the first time. Although in some settings this significant date may be computable as the first of several administrations, in other settings, such as primary care, specific administration dates are not readily available.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication course commenced(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0005">
                <description>*The specific medication item has been reviewed, as planned. This is not intended to capture review of the whole medication list.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication course reviewed(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0006">
                <description>*A single administration of the medication has taken place.(en)</description>
                <text>*Dose administered(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0007">
                <description>*The medication course has been completed as planned.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication course completed(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0008">
                <description>*The prescription has not been dispensed due to a technical or pharamaceutical supply issue.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription supply delayed(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0009">
                <description>*The administration of the medication has been suspended until further notice. No further doses should be given until the restart date or conditions have been met. When setting the date/conditions for restart after suspending, a step from ‘Administrations suspended’ and back to 'Medication start date/condition set' should be performed.(en)</description>
                <text>*Administrations suspended(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0010">
                <description>*A prescription token has been re-issued for an existing medication order.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription re-issued(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0011">
                <description>*Reissuing of this prescription is not available without some intervention.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription re-issue suspended(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0012">
                <description>*The planned course of medication has been cancelled prior to any administration.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication course cancelled(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0013">
                <description>*The scheduled medication course has been postponed prior to any administration.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication course postponed(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0015">
                <description>*The administration of this medication has been ceased after the first dose has been administered, but before intended completion of the course.  (en)</description>
                <text>*Medication course stopped(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0016">
                <description>*The time to start this medication, or other starting condition, has been set.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication start date/condition set(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0017">
                <description>@ internal @</description>
                <text>Tree</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0018">
                <description>*The administration of a medication has been withheld and not given. There is no expectation that it will be given later, though the next dose (if any) should be administered according to the original order.(en)</description>
                <text>*Dose administration omitted(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0020">
                <description>*Name of the medication, vaccine or other therapeutic/prescribable item which was the focus of the activity.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication item(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0021">
                <description>*Reason that the pathway step for the identified medication was carried out.(en)</description>
                <text>*Reason(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0024">
                <description>*Additional narrative about the activity or care pathway step not captured in other fields, including details of any variance between the intended action and the action actually performed.(en)</description>
                <text>*Comment(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0025">
                <description>*The sequence number specific to the activity being recorded.(en)</description>
                <text>*Sequence number(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0030">
                <description>@ internal @</description>
                <text>Tree(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0033">
                <description>*Any guidance, instructions or advice given to the subject of care or personal carer at the time of the pathway step.(en)</description>
                <text>*Patient guidance(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0039">
                <description>*A major change to the order was required, resulting in this order being stopped and a replacement order being started.(en)</description>
                <text>*Major change to order.(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0041">
                <description>*The medication order has been changed in a manner which does not require a new instruction/order to be issued, according to local clinical rules.(en)</description>
                <text>*Minor change to order(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0043">
                <description>*The datetime at which the medication action was scheduled to occur.(en)</description>
                <text>*Original scheduled date/time(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0044">
                <description>*Administration of a dose of mediciation has been delayed but is expected to be given as soon as possible.(en)</description>
                <text>*Dose administration deferred(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0053">
                <description>*Further structured details of the action, possibly specific to a pathway step.(en)</description>
                <text>*Additional details(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0085">
                <description>**(en)</description>
                <text>*Cluster(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0103">
                <description>*Unique identifier for the medication order.(en)</description>
                <text>*Order ID(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0104">
                <description>*Structured details about the medication including strength, form and constituent substances.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication details(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0106">
                <description>*The original medication order has been re-authorised to allow repeat prescription or dispensing. In some jurisdictions an entirely new order must be issued in these circumstances.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription re-authorised(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0109">
                <description>*The medication has been recommended but no steps have been taken to initiate prescribing.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication recommended(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0131">
                <description>*Specific details about the amount of the medication item.(en)</description>
                <text>*Amount(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0132">
                <description>*Subsitution action taken by the person administering or dispensing the drug.(en)</description>
                <text>*Substitution(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0133">
                <description>*The reason or justification for the substitution action taken.(en)</description>
                <text>*Substitution reason(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0138">
                <description>*A medication was substituted which is bioequivalent to that ordered.(en)</description>
                <text>*Substitution performed(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0139">
                <description>*Although allowed by the medication order a bioequvalent medication was not substituted.(en)</description>
                <text>*Substitution not performed(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0140">
                <description>*Details of body site and administration of the medication.(en)</description>
                <text>*Administration details(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0141">
                <description>*Structured description of the site of administration of the ordered item.(en)</description>
                <text>*Body site(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0142">
                <description>*Structured description of the site of administration of the medication, vaccine or therapeutic good.(en)</description>
                <text>*Structured body site(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0143">
                <description>*The technique or device by which the ordered item was, or is to be, administered.(en)</description>
                <text>*Administration method(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0144">
                <description>*Details of the medical device used to assist administration of the medication.(en)</description>
                <text>*Administration device(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0145">
                <description>*Draft prescription has been prepared and is awaiting confirmation from an authorised clinician. May be used where reauthorisations are performed as a batch. This careflow_step may have a status of 'planned' or 'active', reflecting the need to to handle new orders as well as re-authorised orders.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription awaiting authorisation(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0147">
                <description>*The route by which the ordered item was, or is to be, administered into the subject's body.(en)</description>
                <text>*Route(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0148">
                <description>*The medication has been physically prepared. (en)</description>
                <text>*Medication prepared(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0149">
                <description>*The action step has been checked by a separate individual.(en)</description>
                <text>*Double-checked?(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0150">
                <description>*The prescription was cancelled prior to being issued.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription cancelled(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0151">
                <description>*Prescription has been invalidated or has expired without being fulfilled.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription invalid or expired(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0152">
                <description>*The prescription has been fulfilled successfully.(en)</description>
                <text>*Prescription fulfilled(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0153">
                <description>*The medication has been formally authorised for use.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication authorised(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0154">
                <description>*The date/time on which the medication course is set to restart, as per the "Medication restart date/condition set" pathway step.(en)</description>
                <text>*Restart date/time(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0155">
                <description>*The criterion which triggers the medication course to restart, as per the "Medication restart date/condition set" pathway step.(en)</description>
                <text>*Restart criterion(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0156">
                <description>*The clinical reason for the medication activity. (en)</description>
                <text>*Clinical indication (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0157">
                <description>*The prepared medication has been double checked. (en)</description>
                <text>*Medication double checked (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0158">
                <description>*An administration of a dose of the medication was started but was subsequently aborted. (en)</description>
                <text>*Dose administration aborted (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>*Any activity related to the planning, scheduling, prescription management, dispensing, administration, cessation and other use of a medication, vaccine, nutritional product or other therapeutic item.(en)</description>
                <text>*Medication management(en)</text>
            </items>
        </term_definitions>
        <term_definitions language="ca">
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>Qualsevol activitat relacionada amb la planificació, programació, gestió de prescripció, dispensació, administració, cessació i l’ús alternatiu d’una medicació, vacuna, producte nutricional o altre element terapèutic.</description>
                <text>Gestió de la medicació</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0002">
                <description>S’ha emès una prescripció per a la medicació.</description>
                <text>Prescripció emesa</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0003">
                <description>S’ha dispensat la medicació prescrita; per exemple, des d’una farmàcia al pacient.</description>
                <text>Prescripció dispensada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0004">
                <description>El pacient ha pres o se li ha administrat la medicació per primera vegada. Encara que en alguns entorns es pugui computar aquesta data significativa com la primera de diverses administracions, en altres entorns, com atenció primària, les dates d’administració específiques no són fàcilment accessibles.</description>
                <text>Curs de la medicació iniciat</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0005">
                <description>S’ha reavaluat la medicació concreta; per exemple, si s’ha de continuar prenent. Això no pretén recollir una revisió de la llista de medicació.</description>
                <text>Medicació reavaluada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0006">
                <description>S’ha realitzat una única administració de la medicació.</description>
                <text>Dosi administrada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0007">
                <description>El curs de medicació s'ha completat segons allò previst.</description>
                <text>Curs de la medicació completat</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0008">
                <description>No s’ha dispensat la prescripció a causa d'un problema d’abastiment tècnic o farmacèutic.</description>
                <text>Abastiment retardat de la prescripció</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0009">
                <description>S’ha suspès l’administració de la medicació fins a nou avís. No s’han d’administrar més dosis fins que no es compleixin la data o les condicions de reinici. Quan s’estableixin les condicions/data de reinici després de la suspensió, cal realitzar una fase des d'«Administració suspesa» i tornar a «Data d’inici de la medicació/condicions establertes».</description>
                <text>Administració suspesa</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0010">
                <description>S’ha reemès una prescripció per a una prescripció existent.</description>
                <text>Prescripció reemesa</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0011">
                <description>L'expedició de la prescripció està pendent d'una reautorització per part d'un metge.</description>
                <text>Reautorització de la prescripció pendent</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0012">
                <description>S'ha cancel·lat el curs de la medicació previst abans de qualsevol administració.</description>
                <text>Curs de la medicació cancel·lat</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0013">
                <description>S'ha posposat el curs de la medicació programat abans de qualsevol administració.</description>
                <text>Curs de la medicació posposat</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0015">
                <description>S'ha interromput l'administració de la medicació durant el període del curs previst.</description>
                <text>Interrupció de la medicació</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0016">
                <description>S'ha fixat l'hora d'inici de la medicació o una altra condició d'inici.</description>
                <text>Data d’inici de la medicació/condició establerta</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0017">
                <description>@ internal @</description>
                <text>Tree</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0018">
                <description>S’ha retingut i no s’ha administrat un torn d’administració de la medicació. No s’espera que s’administri més tard, encara que la dosi següent (si n’hi hagués) s’ha d’administrar d’acord amb l’ordre original.</description>
                <text>Administració de dosi omesa</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0020">
                <description>Nom del medicament, vacuna o altre element terapèutic/prescriptible en què es va centrar l'activitat.</description>
                <text>Medicament</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0021">
                <description>Motiu pel qual es va realitzar la fase de l’itinerari per a la medicació identificada.</description>
                <text>Motiu</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0024">
                <description>Informació addicional sobre l'activitat o la fase d’itinerari no recollida en altres caselles, inclosos els detalls de qualsevol variació entre l'acció prevista i l'acció que es va realitzar realment.</description>
                <text>Observacions</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0025">
                <description>El nombre de la seqüència específic de la fase d’itinerari que s'està registrant.</description>
                <text>Nombre de la seqüència</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0030">
                <description>@ internal @</description>
                <text>Tree</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0033">
                <description>Qualsevol orientació, instrucció o consell que s’ha donat al subjecte d'assistència o al cuidador personal al moment de la fase d’itinerari.</description>
                <text>Orientació al pacient</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0039">
                <description>Es va requerir un canvi important en la prescripció, raó per la qual es va interrompre aquesta prescripció i es va iniciar una prescripció substituta.</description>
                <text>Canvi important a la prescripció</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0041">
                <description>La prescripció s’ha modificat de manera que no requereixi l’emissió d’una nova prescripció/instrucció, d’acord amb les normes clíniques locals.</description>
                <text>Canvi menor a la prescripció</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0043">
                <description>La data o hora en què estava programat que ocorreguera l’acció de medicació.</description>
                <text>Data/hora programada original</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0044">
                <description>S’ha ajornat l’administració d’una dosi de la medicació, però s’espera que s’administri com més aviat millor.</description>
                <text>Administració de dosi ajornada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0053">
                <description>Dades estructurades complementàries de l'acció, específics possiblement d'una fase d’itinerari.</description>
                <text>Dades addicionals</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0085">
                <description>Informació addicional necessària per a recollir el contingut local o per alinear-se amb altres models/formalismes de referència.</description>
                <text>Extensió</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0103">
                <description>Identificador únic per a la prescripció.</description>
                <text>Identificació de la prescripció</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0104">
                <description>Dades estructurades sobre la medicació, incloses la concentració, forma i substàncies que la componen.</description>
                <text>Dades de la medicació</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0106">
                <description>S’ha reautoritzat la prescripció original per a permetre que es repeteixin tant la prescripció com la dispensació. En algunes jurisdiccions, s’ha d’emetre una prescripció nova en aquestes circumstàncies.</description>
                <text>Prescripció reautoritzada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0109">
                <description>S’ha recomanat la medicació, però no s’ha iniciat cap procés per a començar la prescripció.</description>
                <text>Medicació recomanada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0131">
                <description>Dades específiques sobre la quantitat de l’element de medicació.</description>
                <text>Quantitat</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0132">
                <description>Acció de substitució adoptada per la persona que administra o dispensa el medicament.</description>
                <text>Substitució</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0133">
                <description>Motiu o justificació de l'acció de substitució adoptada.</description>
                <text>Motiu de la substitució</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0138">
                <description>Una medicació es va substituir per una altra bioequivalent a la prescrita.</description>
                <text>Substitució realitzada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0139">
                <description>Encara que la prescripció ho permetia, no es va substituir una medicació bioequivalent.</description>
                <text>Substitució no realitzada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0140">
                <description>Dades sobre la zona del cos i l'administració de la medicació.</description>
                <text>Dades de l'administració</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0141">
                <description>Descripció estructurada de la zona d'administració de l’element prescrit.</description>
                <text>Zona del cos</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0142">
                <description>Descripció estructurada de la zona d'administració de la medicació, vacuna o producte terapèutic.</description>
                <text>Zona del cos estructurada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0143">
                <description>Tècnica o dispositiu mitjançant el qual es va administrar o administrarà l’element prescrit.</description>
                <text>Mètode d'administració</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0144">
                <description>Dades del dispositiu mèdic utilitzat per ajudar a administrar la medicació.</description>
                <text>Dispositiu d'administració</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0145">
                <description>S’ha preparat un esborrany de la prescripció i està pendent de confirmació per part d’un metge autoritzat. Es pot utilitzar quan les reautoritzacions es fan per lots. Aquest careflow_step pot tenir un estat «planificat» o «actiu», cosa que reflecteix la necessitat de gestionar tant prescripcions noves com prescripcions reautoritzades.</description>
                <text>Prescripció en espera per autorització</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0147">
                <description>Via per la qual l’element prescrit s'ha administrat o s'administrarà en el cos del subjecte.</description>
                <text>Via d'administració</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0148">
                <description>S’ha preparat la medicació físicament.</description>
                <text>Medicació preparada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0149">
                <description>La fase d’itinerari s'ha comprovat per una persona diferent.</description>
                <text>Verificació</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0150">
                <description>La prescripció es cancel·là abans de ser emesa.</description>
                <text>Prescripció cancel·lada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0151">
                <description>S’ha invalidat la prescripció o ha caducat sense completar-se.</description>
                <text>Prescripció no vàlida o caducada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0152">
                <description>La prescripció s'ha finalitzat correctament.</description>
                <text>Prescripció finalitzada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0153">
                <description>S’ha autoritzat formalment l’ús de la medicació.</description>
                <text>Medicació autoritzada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0154">
                <description>Data/hora en què el curs de medicació està programat per reiniciar-se, segons la fase de l’itinerari «Administració suspesa».</description>
                <text>Data/hora de reinici</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0155">
                <description>El criteri que provoca el reinici del curs de la medicació, segons la fase de l’itinerari «Administració suspesa».</description>
                <text>Criteri de reinici</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0156">
                <description>Motiu clínic de l'activitat de medicació.</description>
                <text>Indicació clínica</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0157">
                <description>S’ha comprovat la medicació preparada amb minuciositat.</description>
                <text>Medicació verificada</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0158">
                <description>*An administration of a dose of the medication was started but was subsequently aborted. (en)</description>
                <text>*Dose administration aborted (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>Qualsevol activitat relacionada amb la planificació, programació, gestió de prescripció, dispensació, administració, cessació i l’ús alternatiu d’una medicació, vacuna, producte nutricional o altre element terapèutic.</description>
                <text>Gestió de la medicació</text>
            </items>
        </term_definitions>
    </component_terminologies>
    <component_terminologies archetype_id="openEHR-EHR-ACTION.procedure.v1" original_language="en">
        <concept_code>at0000</concept_code>
        <term_definitions language="de">
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>Eine klinische Aktivität, die zur Früherkennung, Untersuchung, Diagnose, Heilung, Therapie, Bewertung oder in Hinsicht auf palliative Maßnahmen durchgeführt wird.</description>
                <text>Prozedur</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0001">
                <description>@ internal @</description>
                <text>Tree</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0002">
                <description>Identifizierung der Prozedur über den Namen.</description>
                <text>Name der Prozedur</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0003">
                <description>Strukturierte Informationen über die Prozedur.</description>
                <text>Details zur Prozedur</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0004">
                <description>Die Prozedur, die durchgeführt werden soll, ist geplant.</description>
                <text>Geplante Prozedur</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0005">
                <description>Zusätzliche Beschreibung der Aktivität oder der "Pathway"-Verlaufsschritte, die in anderen Bereichen nicht erfasst wurden.</description>
                <text>Kommentar</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0006">
                <description>Details zu allen Komplikationen, die sich aus der Prozedur ergeben haben.</description>
                <text>Komplikationen</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0007">
                <description>Der Auftrag für die Prozedur wurde versendet.</description>
                <text>Auftrag für Prozedur versendet</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0014">
                <description>Grund, warum die angegebene Aktivität für diese Prozedur durchgeführt wurde.</description>
                <text>Grund</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0034">
                <description>Dieses Element ist veraltet, da es fälschlicherweise mit dem Status "initial" verknüpft war - verwenden Sie das neue Element "Prozedur geplant" (at0004), das korrekt mit dem Status "geplant" verknüpft ist.</description>
                <text>X - Prozedur geplant</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0035">
                <description>Dieses Element ist veraltet, da es fälschlicherweise mit dem Status "initial" verknüpft war - verwenden Sie das neue Element "Geplante Prozedur" (at0007), das korrekt mit dem Status "geplant" verknüpft ist.</description>
                <text>X - Auftrag für Prozedur versendet</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0036">
                <description>Ein Termin für die Prozedur wurde geplant.</description>
                <text>geplanter Termin der Prozedur</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0038">
                <description>Die Prozedur wurde verschoben.</description>
                <text>Prozedur verschoben</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0039">
                <description>Die geplante Prozedur wurde vor Beginn storniert.</description>
                <text>Prozedur storniert</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0040">
                <description>Die Prozedur wurde unterbrochen.</description>
                <text>Prozedur unterbrochen</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0041">
                <description>Die Prozedur wurde abgebrochen.</description>
                <text>Prozedur abgebrochen</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0043">
                <description>Die Prozedur wurde durchgeführt und alle damit verbundenen klinischen Aktivitäten wurden beendet.</description>
                <text>Prozedur beendet</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0047">
                <description>Die Prozedur, oder eine Subprozedur in einem mehrstufigen Vorgehen, wurde durchgeführt.</description>
                <text>Prozedur durchgeführt</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0048">
                <description>Ausgang der durchgeführten Prozedur.</description>
                <text>Ausgang</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0049">
                <description>Beschreibung der Prozedur, angepasst an den "Pathway"-Verlaufsschritt.</description>
                <text>Beschreibung</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0053">
                <description>@ internal @</description>
                <text>Tree</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0054">
                <description>Die lokale ID, die dem Auftrag vom Gesundheitsdienstleister oder der Organisation, die die Leistung anfordert, zugewiesen wurde.</description>
                <text>Auftragskennung des Antragstellers</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0055">
                <description>Angaben über den Gesundheitsdienstleister oder die Organisation, die die Leistung anfordert.</description>
                <text>Antragsteller</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0056">
                <description>Die ID, die dem Auftrag von dem Gesundheitsdienstleister oder der Organisation, die die Leistungsanforderung erhält, zugewiesen wurde. Dies wird auch als "Filler Order Identifier" bezeichnet.</description>
                <text>Auftragskennung des Empfängers</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0057">
                <description>Angaben über den Gesundheitsdienstleister oder die Organisation, die die Leistungsanforderung erhält.</description>
                <text>Empfänger</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0058">
                <description>Dringlichkeit der Prozedur.</description>
                <text>Dringlichkeit</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0060">
                <description>Das Datum und/oder die Uhrzeit, an dem die gesamte Prozedur, oder die letzte Komponente einer mehrstufigen Prozedur, beendet wurde.</description>
                <text>Enddatum/-uhrzeit</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0061">
                <description>Die Gesamtdauer der Prozedur - diese kann sich aus der aktiven Phase und der Phase, in der die Prozedur unterbrochen wurde, ergeben.</description>
                <text>Gesamtdauer</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0062">
                <description>Multimediale Darstellung der durchgeführten Prozedur.</description>
                <text>Multimedia</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0063">
                <description>Anatomische Lokalisation, an der die Prozedur durchgeführt wird.</description>
                <text>Körperstelle</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0064">
                <description>Zusätzliche Informationen, die erforderlich sind, um lokale Inhalte zu erfassen oder mit anderen Referenzmodellen/Formalismen abzugleichen.</description>
                <text>Erweiterung</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0065">
                <description>Identifizierung der spezifischen Prozedurmethode oder -technik.</description>
                <text>Methode</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0066">
                <description>Das Datum und/oder die Uhrzeit für die die Prozedur angesetzt ist.</description>
                <text>Geplantes Datum/Uhrzeit</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0067">
                <description>Die Art der Prozedur.</description>
                <text>Art der Prozedur</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0068">
                <description>Die Prozedur, oder eine Subprozedur in einem mehrstufigen Vorgehen, wurde begonnen.</description>
                <text>Prozedur begonnen</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0069">
                <description>Schwierigkeiten oder Probleme, die während der Durchführung der Prozedur aufgetreten sind.</description>
                <text>Schwierigkeiten bei der Durchführung der Prozedur</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0070">
                <description>Der klinische oder prozessbezogene Grund für die Prozedur.</description>
                <text>Indikation</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0071">
                <description>Beurteilung der Auswirkungen eines Eingriffs oder seines Ergebnisses für einen bestimmten Patienten.</description>
                <text>Auswirkungen</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0072">
                <description>*The intended outcome of the procedure.(en)</description>
                <text>*Intent(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0073">
                <description>*The date or datetime when the entire procedure, or the first component of a multicomponent procedure, was first started.(en)</description>
                <text>*Start datetime(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0074">
                <description>*The duration of time between the start of the most recent pathway step for this procedure and the start of the current pathway step.(en)</description>
                <text>*Pathway step duration(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>Eine klinische Aktivität, die zur Früherkennung, Untersuchung, Diagnose, Heilung, Therapie, Bewertung oder in Hinsicht auf palliative Maßnahmen durchgeführt wird.</description>
                <text>Prozedur</text>
            </items>
        </term_definitions>
        <term_definitions language="ru">
            <items id="at0000">
                <description>*A clinical activity carried out for screening, investigative, diagnostic, curative, therapeutic, evaluative or palliative purposes.(en)</description>
                <text>*Procedure(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0001">
                <description>*@ internal @(en)</description>
                <text>*Tree(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0002">
                <description>*Identification of the procedure by name.(en)</description>
                <text>*Procedure name(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0003">
                <description>*Structured information about the procedure. Use to capture detailed, structured information about anatomical location, method &amp; technique, equipment used, devices implanted, results, findings etc.(en)</description>
                <text>*Procedure detail(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0004">
                <description>*</description>
                <text>*Procedure planned (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0005">
                <description>*Additional narrative about the procedure or care pathway step not captured in other fields. (en)</description>
                <text>*Comment(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0006">
                <description>*Details about any complication arising from the procedure.(en)</description>
                <text>*Complication(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0007">
                <description>*</description>
                <text>*Procedure request sent (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0014">
                <description>*Reason that the activity or care pathway step for the identified procedure was carried out.(en)</description>
                <text>*Reason(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0034">
                <description>*The procedure to be undertaken is planned.(en)</description>
                <text>*Procedure planned(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0035">
                <description>*Request for procedure sent.(en)</description>
                <text>*Procedure request sent(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0036">
                <description>*The procedure has been scheduled.(en)</description>
                <text>*Procedure scheduled(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0038">
                <description>*The procedure has been postponed.(en)</description>
                <text>*Procedure postponed(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0039">
                <description>*The planned procedure has been cancelled prior to commencement.(en)</description>
                <text>*Procedure cancelled(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0040">
                <description>*The procedure has been suspended.(en)</description>
                <text>*Procedure suspended(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0041">
                <description>*The procedure has been aborted.(en)</description>
                <text>*Procedure aborted(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0043">
                <description>*The procedure has been performed and all associated clinical activities completed.(en)</description>
                <text>*Procedure completed(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0047">
                <description>*The procedure, or subprocedure in a multicomponent procedure, has been performed.(en)</description>
                <text>*Procedure performed(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0048">
                <description>*Outcome of procedure performed.(en)</description>
                <text>*Outcome(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0049">
                <description>*Narrative description about the procedure, as appropriate for the pathway step.(en)</description>
                <text>*Description(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0053">
                <description>*@ internal @(en)</description>
                <text>*Tree(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0054">
                <description>*The local ID assigned to the order by the healthcare provider or organisation requesting the service.(en)</description>
                <text>*Requestor order identifier(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0055">
                <description>Подробности о заказчике (организации), запросившей услугу</description>
                <text>Заказчик</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0056">
                <description>*The ID assigned to the order by the healthcare provider or organisation receiving the request for service. This is also referred to as Filler Order Identifier.(en)</description>
                <text>*Receiver order identifier(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0057">
                <description>Подробные сведение об организации, получившей заявку на выполнение процедуры</description>
                <text>Исполнитель</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0058">
                <description>*Urgency of the procedure.(en)</description>
                <text>*Urgency(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0060">
                <description>*The date or datetime when the entire procedure, or the last component of a multicomponent procedure, was finished. (en)</description>
                <text>*End datetime (en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0061">
                <description>*The total amount of time taken to complete the procedure, which may include time spent during the active phase of the procedure plus time during which the procedure was suspended.(en)</description>
                <text>*Total duration(en)</text>
            </items>
            <items id="at0062">
